\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 What is Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s game in suddenly defending  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights?\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 894 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 October 2024\par 16:59 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par 26\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s unclear whether the ex-first lady is trying to help or hurt husband Donald by revealing pro-choice views in new book\par \par \uc2 When news broke on Wednesday evening that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/melania-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Melania Trump}}}\uc2  supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights \u8211\'20\'13 and apparently has for her entire adult life \u8211\'20\'13 it was greeted with surprise and confusion.\par \par \uc2 Melania\u8217\'20\'19s husband, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2 , is trying to rapidly recalibrate his approach to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as he races towards election day. Is his wife trying to help him? Hurt him? Or neither?\par \par \uc2 In her forthcoming memoir, Melania Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/02/melania-trump-memoir-defends-abortion-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 went into extensive detail}}}\uc2  about her support for the procedure.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhy should anyone other than the woman herself have the power to determine what she does with her own body?\u8221\'20\'1D she wrote. \u8220\'20\'1CA woman\u8217\'20\'19s fundamental right of individual liberty, to her own life, grants her the authority to terminate her pregnancy if she wishes.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Shortly after the \uc2 Guardian\uc2  broke the news, Trump uploaded a black-and-white video of herself to social media, set to stirring music.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWithout a doubt, there is no room for compromise when it comes to this essential right that all women possess from birth,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CIndividual freedom. What does my body, my choice really mean?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The news of Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights comes at a time when her husband is striving to convince voters that he can be trusted to protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 In the years since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned Roe v Wade in 2022, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  has become Republicans\u8217\'20\'19 achilles heel. It cost Republicans victories in the 2022 midterms, while \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters have won a string of ballot measures even in states as red as Kentucky, Kansas and Ohio.\par \par \uc2 Earlier on in his campaign, Trump attempted to be all-things-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to everybody, alternately bragging about his role in overturning Roe \u8211\'20\'13 by appointing three of the justices who voted for its demise \u8211\'20\'13 and grousing that hardline positions on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  were costing the GOP elections. But since {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris}}}\uc2 , an extraordinarily effective messenger on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , became the Democratic nominee for president, he has abandoned that approach in favor of garbled support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWOMEN WILL BE HAPPY, HEALTH, CONFIDENT AND FREE!\u8221\'20\'1D Trump recently posted on Truth Social. \u8220\'20\'1CYOU WILL NO LONGER BE THINKING ABOUT \b \highlight22\uc2 ABORTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 , BECAUSE IT IS NOW WHERE IT ALWAYS HAD TO BE, WITH THE STATES.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s revelation, then, could be intended to reassure undecided voters who are disinclined to vote for Harris but support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights \u8211\'20\'13 as a majority of Americans do. But Tresa Undem, a pollster who has surveyed people on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for more than two decades, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/02/melania-trump-abortion-views-revelation-reaction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said the odds of such comments appealing to moderates}}}\uc2  or \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -supporting conservatives were \u8220\'20\'1Cfairly slim\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 After all, regardless of her personal convictions, it seems unlikely that Melania Trump has any real sway over her tempestuous husband\u8217\'20\'19s policies. Her pro-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights beliefs did not stop \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  from helping to demolish Roe. It also doesn\u8217\'20\'19t help that Melania and \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s relationship is, at least in public, far from cozy. (He recently indicated, despite having written the foreword, that he hasn\u8217\'20\'19t read the book.)\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNothing Republicans say will distract the American people from the reality they see with their own eyes: story after story of victims of rape and incest being forced into pregnancy, doctors forced to turn away patients during miscarriages and ectopic pregnancies and women literally dying because of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans,\u8221\'20\'1D Emilia Rowland, Democratic national committee press secretary, said in a text.\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s disagreement with her husband is also not as novel as it may seem. Betty Ford, the wife of the Republican president Gerald Ford, was an adamant supporter of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, said Mary Ziegler, a \uc2 University of California Davis\uc2  school of law professor who studies the legal history of reproduction. It didn\u8217\'20\'19t end up making much of a difference in Gerald Ford\u8217\'20\'19s campaign.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think people understand that Melania and \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  are very different people,\u8221\'20\'1D Ziegler said. \u8220\'20\'1CI could see independent and swing voters saying: \u8216\'20\'18Wow. It\u8217\'20\'19s bad that even \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s wife doesn\u8217\'20\'19t like \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s position.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s news seems to have done is anger the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists who have made up some of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s most reliable supporters. These activists were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/aug/30/trump-ivf-anti-abortion-groups"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 already annoyed by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s recent attempts}}}\uc2  to paint himself as an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights champion.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMelania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s support of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is anti-feminist and clearly outside the teaching of our Catholic faith. She is wrong,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Kristan Hawkins\uc2 , president of the pro-life organization Students for Life of America, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/KristanHawkins/status/1841632290264203550"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted on X}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CWhat a lost opportunity to inspire a generation of young women.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s strategy, such as it is, may be much more straightforward than activists and politicos may think. She has never seemed particularly interested in being first lady, and she doesn\u8217\'20\'19t appear to be invested in winning the job back, seeing as she has largely disappeared from the 2024 campaign trail.\par \par \uc2 But Trump does seem interested in doing at least one thing: selling books. Suggesting that there is controversy within her memoir\u8217\'20\'19s pages probably helps move copies.\par \par \uc2 Or not. In her post, Hawkins added: \u8220\'20\'1CI won\u8217\'20\'19t be buying Melania\u8217\'20\'19s book.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241003eka3002jq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
