\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Melania Trump passionately defends  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights in upcoming memoir\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 1,344 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 October 2024\par 16:26 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par 1\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Exclusive: \u8216\'20\'18I have carried this belief with me throughout my entire adult life,\u8217\'20\'19 former first lady writes in memoirMelania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  views baffle both sides\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump made an extraordinary declaration in an eagerly awaited memoir to be published a month from election day: she is a passionate supporter of a woman\u8217\'20\'19s right to control her own body \u8211\'20\'13 including the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is imperative to guarantee that women have autonomy in deciding their preference of having children, based on their own convictions, free from any intervention or pressure from the government,\u8221\'20\'1D the Republican nominee\u8217\'20\'19s wife writes, amid a campaign in which \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s threats to women\u8217\'20\'19s reproductive rights have played a central role.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhy should anyone other than the woman herself have the power to determine what she does with her own body? A woman\u8217\'20\'19s fundamental right of individual liberty, to her own life, grants her the authority to terminate her pregnancy if she wishes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRestricting a woman\u8217\'20\'19s right to choose whether to terminate an unwanted pregnancy is the same as denying her control over her own body. I have carried this belief with me throughout my entire adult life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump has rarely expressed political views in public. Her book, Melania, which reveals the former first lady to be so firmly out of step with most of her own party, will be published in the US next Tuesday. \uc2 The Guardian\uc2  obtained a copy.\par \par \uc2 Her decision to include a full-throated expression of support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights is remarkable not just given her proximity to a Republican candidate running on an anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  platform, but also given {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/jul/29/abortion-laws-bans-by-state"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the severe deterioration}}}\uc2  of women\u8217\'20\'19s reproductive rights under \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and the GOP.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 In 2022}}}\uc2 , in the supreme court case Dobbs v Jackson, three justices installed when \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  was president voted to strike down Roe v Wade, the ruling which had protected federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights since 1973. Republican-run states have since instituted draconian \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has tried to both take credit for the Dobbs decision \u8211\'20\'13 long the central aim of evangelical and conservative Catholic donors and voters \u8211\'20\'13 and avoid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/22/gretchen-whitmer-calls-trump-deranged-after-comments-on-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the fury it has stoked}}}\uc2 , saying \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights should be decided by the states.\par \par \uc2 But Democrats have scored a succession of election wins by campaigning on the issue, even in conservative states, and threats to reproductive rights, among them threats to fertility treatments {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/17/senate-vote-ivf-bill-democrats-republicans-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 including IVF}}}\uc2 , are proving problematic for Republicans up and down this year\u8217\'20\'19s ticket.\par \par \uc2 Amid a blizzard of statements opponents deem misogynistic and regressive, JD Vance, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s pick for vice-president, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/07/17/politics/kfile-jd-vance-abortion-comments/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicated}}}\uc2  he would support a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban \u8211\'20\'13 a move it seems his boss\u8217\'20\'19s wife would be against.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  himself recently got into a tangle over whether he would vote in November to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://19thnews.org/2023/12/abortion-states-election-2024-ballot-measures/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 protect \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights in Florida}}}\uc2 , a ballot his wife will also cast given their residence at Mar-a-Lago in Palm Beach. He eventually said he would vote no. Judging by her own words, Melania Trump appears likely to vote yes.\par \par \uc2 Her memoir is slim, long on descriptions of her youth in Slovenia, life as a model in New York and love for the man whose third wife she became, correspondingly short on policy discussion. \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  provides a blurb, praising his wife\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Ccommitment to excellence \u8230\'20\'26 insightful perspective \u8230\'20\'26 [and] entrepreneurial achievements\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Before discussing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Melania Trump says she {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/03/melania-trump-donald-immigration-jacket-slogan-book"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disagreed}}}\uc2  with her husband on some aspects of immigration policy, not least as an immigrant herself.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COccasional political disagreements between me and my husband,\u8221\'20\'1D she writes, are \u8220\'20\'1Cpart of our relationship, but I believed in addressing them privately rather than publicly challenging him.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 And yet, later in her book, she states views on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and reproductive rights diametrically opposed to those of her husband and his party.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI have always believed it is critical for people to take care of themselves first,\u8221\'20\'1D Melania Trump writes. \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s a very straightforward concept; in fact, we are all born with a set of fundamental rights, including the right to enjoy our lives. We are all entitled to maintain a gratifying and dignified existence.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis common-sense approach applies to a woman\u8217\'20\'19s natural right to make decisions about her own body and health.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump says her beliefs about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights spring from \u8220\'20\'1Ca core set of principles\u8221\'20\'1D, at the heart of which sit \u8220\'20\'1Cindividual liberty\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cpersonal freedom\u8221\'20\'1D, on which there is \u8220\'20\'1Cno room for negotiation\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Detailing \u8220\'20\'1Clegitimate reasons for a woman to choose to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D, she includes danger to the life of the mother, rape or incest, often exceptions under state bans, and also \u8220\'20\'1Ca congenital birth defect, plus severe medical conditions\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Saying \u8220\'20\'1Ctiming matters\u8221\'20\'1D, Melania Trump also defends the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  later in pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 She writes: \u8220\'20\'1CIt is important to note that historically, most abortions conducted during the later stages of pregnancy were the result of severe fetal abnormalities that probably would have led to the death or stillbirth of the child. Perhaps even the death of the mother. These cases were extremely rare and typically occurred after several consultations between the woman and her doctor. As a community, we should embrace these common-sense standards. Again, timing matters.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 More than 90% of US abortions occur at or before 13 weeks of gestation, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cdc.gov/mmwr/volumes/72/ss/ss7209a1.htm?s_cid=ss7209a1_w#T3_down"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to data from the CDC}}}\uc2 . Less than 1% of abortions take place at or after 21 weeks.\par \par \uc2 On the campaign trail, Republicans have blatantly mischaracterized Democratic positions on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Last month, debating \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  falsely {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thecut.com/article/trumps-abortion-debate-lies-debunked.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  his opponent\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cvice-presidential pick \u8230\'20\'26 says that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the ninth month is absolutely fine. [\uc2 Tim Walz\uc2 ] also says: \u8216\'20\'18Execution after birth\u8217\'20\'19 \u8211\'20\'13 execution, no longer \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  because the baby is born \u8211\'20\'13 is OK.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/09/11/media/abc-moderators-debate-fact-check-trump-harris-false-claims/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 factchecked}}}\uc2  : it is not legal in any state to kill a baby after birth.\par \par \uc2 In response to news of Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, Sarafina Chitika, a spokesperson for the Harris-Walz campaign, said in a statement: \u8220\'20\'1CSadly for the women across America, Mrs Trump\u8217\'20\'19s husband firmly disagrees with her and is the reason that more than one in three American women live under a Trump \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Ban that threatens their health, their freedom, and their lives.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has made it abundantly clear: if he wins in November, he will ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  nationwide, punish women, and restrict women\u8217\'20\'19s access to reproductive health care.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Trump campaign did not immediately comment.\par \par \uc2 On social media, Melania Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/03/melania-trump-memoir-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 doubled down}}}\uc2 , posting a short video in which she paraphrased remarks in her book.\par \par \uc2 On the page, Melania Trump issues a distinctly un-Trumpian appeal for empathy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMany women opt for abortions due to personal medical concerns,\u8221\'20\'1D she writes. \u8220\'20\'1CThese situations with significant moral implications weigh heavily on the woman and her family and deserve our empathy. Consider, for example, the complexity inherent in the decision of whether the mother should risk her own life to give birth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Recent reporting has highlighted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/sep/25/abortion-bans-healthcare-maternal-mortality"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cases}}}\uc2  of women who have died in states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been banned.\par \par \uc2 She goes on to appeal for compassion.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen confronted with an unexpected pregnancy, young women frequently experience feelings of isolation and significant stress. I, like most Americans, am in favor of the requirement that juveniles obtain parental consent before undergoing an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I realize this may not always be possible. Our next generation must be provided with knowledge, security, safety, and solace, and the cultural stigma associated with \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  must be lifted,\u8221\'20\'1D writes the former first lady.\par \par \uc2 Finally, Melania Trump offers an expression of solidarity with protesters for reproductive rights.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe slogan \u8216\'20\'18My Body, My Choice\u8217\'20\'19 is typically associated with women activists and those who align with the pro-choice side of the debate,\u8221\'20\'1D she writes. \u8220\'20\'1CBut if you really think about it, \u8216\'20\'18My Body, My Choice\u8217\'20\'19 applies to both sides \u8211\'20\'13 a woman\u8217\'20\'19s right to make an independent decision involving her own body, including the right to choose life. Personal freedom.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241002eka20035z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
