\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  views baffle both sides: \u8216\'20\'18Hard to follow the logic\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 667 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 October 2024\par 11:33 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Former first lady voices support for procedure in memoir despite her husband\u8217\'20\'19s hand in overturning Roe v WadeExclusive: Melania Trump defends \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in upcoming memoir\par \par \uc2 The revelation on Wednesday evening that Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/02/melania-trump-memoir-defends-abortion-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forthcoming memoir includes a full-throated defense of \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights}}}\uc2 , an issue her husband \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has repeatedly flip-flopped on during his presidential campaign, left people on both sides of the issue less than impressed.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRestricting a woman\u8217\'20\'19s right to choose whether to terminate an unwanted pregnancy is the same as denying her control over her own body,\u8221\'20\'1D Melania Trump wrote in her memoir. \u8220\'20\'1CI have carried this belief with me throughout my entire adult life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump also defended the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  later on in pregnancy \u8211\'20\'13 a procedure that her husband has repeatedly demonized. (Less than 1% of abortions occur at or past 21 weeks of gestation.)\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSadly for the women across America, Mrs Trump\u8217\'20\'19s husband firmly disagrees with her and is the reason that more than one in three American women live under a Trump \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban that threatens their health, their freedom and their lives,\u8221\'20\'1D a Harris campaign spokesperson, Sarafina Chitika, said in an email. \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has made it abundantly clear: If he wins in November, he will ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  nationwide, punish women and restrict women\u8217\'20\'19s access to reproductive health care.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s remarks also took anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists by surprise.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s hard to follow the logic of putting out the former First Lady\u8217\'20\'19s book right before the election undercutting President Trump\u8217\'20\'19s message to pro-life voters,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Kristan Hawkins\uc2 , president of the powerful Students for Life of America, posted on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 /X on Wednesday night. \u8220\'20\'1CWhat a waste of momentum.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Over the last several weeks, anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/aug/30/trump-ivf-anti-abortion-groups"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 grown increasingly fed up with the former president}}}\uc2 , who has struggled, alongside the rest of the Republican party, to redefine his messaging on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights amid outrage over the overturning of Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 Earlier in his campaign, Trump bragged about appointing three of the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  justices who voted to overturn Roe, branded himself the \u8220\'20\'1Cmost pro-life president ever\u8221\'20\'1D. After \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  became the presidential nominee, however, Trump has pledged that his administration \u8220\'20\'1Cwill be great for women and their reproductive rights\u8221\'20\'1D and has vowed not to sign a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban \u8211\'20\'13 just weeks after refusing to say that he would veto one.\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s comments may feel like a further insult to the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  voters who feel abandoned by Trump, said the Republican campaign strategist Liz Mair, adding anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  advocates run potent get-out-the-vote operations. Those advocates were key to Trump\u8217\'20\'19s 2016 victory.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis might be just another thing that piles on to make pro-lifers think: \u8216\'20\'18I just can\u8217\'20\'19t with this guy.\u8217\'20\'19 A lot of them were single-issue voters anyway,\u8221\'20\'1D Mair said. \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s not really giving them much of an incentive to show up and do anything to his benefit.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 When Tresa Undem, a pollster who has surveyed people about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for more than two decades, heard the comments, she immediately thought: \u8220\'20\'1CWow\u8221\'20\'1D. Then she thought: \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s a campaign move.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, Undem is not sure who, exactly, the move is for \u8211\'20\'13 especially given the Trumps\u8217\'20\'19 sometimes frosty relationship in public. Melania Trump has rarely aired her political views and has largely vanished from \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 2024 campaign.\par \par \uc2 The odds of Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s comments comforting moderate or conservative voters who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights are \u8220\'20\'1Cfairly slim\u8221\'20\'1D, Undem said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThese strong feelings \u8211\'20\'13 they did not suddenly appear this year, right? So she clearly has had no influence on him when it comes to policy related to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Undem said. \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t think she\u8217\'20\'19s ever been positioned, or voters ever think of her, as having any kind of policy position or weight or influence on Trump.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241003eka30002u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
