\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  calls Trump \u8216\'20\'18deranged\u8217\'20\'19 after comments on  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Coral Murphy Marcos \par \uc2 369 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 September 2024\par 18:05 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Michigan governor responds to ex-president saying women will no longer be thinking about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  if he wins election\par \par \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2 , the governor of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/michigan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michigan}}}\uc2 , called {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cjust deranged\u8221\'20\'1D on Sunday after he said women would no longer be thinking about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  if he is elected as president in November.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis guy just doesn\u8217\'20\'19t understand what the average woman is confronting in her life in this country, and how could he? He\u8217\'20\'19s not lived a normal life,\u8221\'20\'1D Whitmer said in an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/atrupar/status/1837841173177651449"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  on CNN\u8217\'20\'19s State of the Union.\par \par \uc2 Whitmer also reaffirmed her support for \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , describing her as a person \u8220\'20\'1Cwho has worked hourly jobs, who knows how important it is that women have healthcare and access to the medical care that they need\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Whitmer was asked to comment about a speech the former president delivered on Saturday, saying women \u8220\'20\'1Cwill be happy, healthy, confident, and free\u8221\'20\'1D if he is elected president.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s just deranged,\u8221\'20\'1D the governor of Michigan said.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, Trump made similar comments about women on his Truth Social platform.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWOMEN ARE POORER THAN THEY WERE FOUR YEARS AGO, ARE LESS HEALTHY THAN THEY WERE FOUR YEARS AGO \u8230\'20\'26 AND ARE LESS OPTIMISTIC AND CONFIDENT IN THE FUTURE THAN THEY WERE FOUR YEARS AGO!\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said.\par \par \uc2 Harris is a staunch supporter of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. The vice-president delivered {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/20/kamala-harris-trump-abortion-wisconsin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two speeches on Friday}}}\uc2 , first in Georgia and then Wisconsin, highlighting the case of Amber Thurman, who died in Georgia due to a strict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 Whitmer\u8217\'20\'19s comments on Sunday come a week after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/sep/19/donald-trump-rally-apparent-assassination-attempt-new-york-election-campaign-kamala-harris-us-politics-latest-news?filterKeyEvents=false&page=with%3Ablock-66ec2d0d8f089e4a13dfa73a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 participating in an online campaign event}}}\uc2  with TV host, producer and author \uc2 Oprah Winfrey\uc2 , which was livestreamed nationally from Michigan.\par \par \uc2 The Michigan governor was previously named as a possible candidate for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/08/gretchen-whitmer-biden-democrat-nomination"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democratic nomination for president}}}\uc2  before ruling herself out in July. Michigan is a must-win prize for candidates, a state that has voted for the presidential winner in the last four national elections.\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  took Michigan by 154,000 votes in 2020. Two years later, Whitmer defeated a Trump-backed candidate and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/nov/17/michigan-democrats-state-senate-house"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democrats took full control}}}\uc2  for the first time in 45 years.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240922ek9m001pb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
