\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 First Thing: Trump stages first rally since apparent assassination attempt\b0\par\par\uc2 Clea Skopeliti \par \uc2 1,072 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 September 2024\par 10:59 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Presidential nominee claims God saved him and apparent attempts on his life have made him tougher. Plus, how to win at canapesDon\u8217\'20\'19t already get First Thing in your inbox? Sign up here\par \par \uc2 Good morning.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/19/donald-trump-new-york-rally-nassau-coliseum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 staged his first rally on Wednesday night since the second apparent attempt}}}\uc2  on his life, telling his supporters in New York that \u8220\'20\'1Cthese encounters with death\u8221\'20\'1D had made him stronger and attributing his survival to divine intervention.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGod has now spared my life. It must have been God, not once, but twice,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said to raucous cheers from the crowd in the Nassau Coliseum in the Long Island suburbs.\par \par \uc2 In a 90-minute speech, Trump further inflamed tensions by calling Haitian immigrants in Springfield, Ohio, \u8220\'20\'1Cillegal aliens\u8221\'20\'1D, despite the vast majority being legal residents on temporary protected status. He also returned to well-trodden ground of election denial and attacking the media, as well as making false claims about global heating.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Why did he pick New York? While \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  has a double-digit lead in the state overall, Long Island itself has moved to the right in recent years.\par \par \uc2 Iran sent hacked Trump documents to Biden campaign, \uc2 FBI\uc2  says\par \par \uc2 Iranian hackers sent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/19/iran-sent-hacked-trump-documents-to-biden-campaign-fbi-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 material stolen from Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s campaign}}}\uc2  to \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s in an attempt to influence November\u8217\'20\'19s election, sending unsolicited emails to people associated with the former Democratic candidate, the \uc2 FBI\uc2  and other US agencies have said.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FBI\uc2  said on 12 August it was looking into a complaint by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s campaign that Iran had hacked and leaked sensitive information, with intelligence officials confirming Iran to be the actor a week later.\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s campaign called the emails, which were received by a small number of people and regarded as spam or phishing messages, as \u8220\'20\'1Cunwelcome and unacceptable malicious activity\u8221\'20\'1D. There is no suggestion that the recipients in the Democrat campaign team responded, officials said on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Why would Iran do this? Intelligence officials say the state opposes Trump\u8217\'20\'19s re-election, thinking he will worsen relations between Washington and Tehran.\par \par \uc2 Impossible to know if walkie-talkies used by \uc2 Hezbollah\uc2  were \u8216\'20\'18from our company\u8217\'20\'19, says Japanese firm\par \par \uc2 Icom\uc2 , the Japanese communication equipment manufacturer whose walkie-talkies are thought to have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2024/sep/19/lebanon-blasts-impossible-to-know-if-walkie-talkies-used-by-hezbollah-were-from-our-company-says-japanese-firm-live?page=with:block-66ebca6c8f08893ca2b3a45f#block-66ebca6c8f08893ca2b3a45f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blown up in Lebanon on Wednesday}}}\uc2 , said the devices may have been an old model in which explosive batteries were planted.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe can\u8217\'20\'19t rule out the possibility that they are fakes, but there is also a chance the products are our IC-V82 model,\u8221\'20\'1D said \uc2 Icom\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s director, \uc2 Yoshiki Enomoto\uc2 . He added that production of the model ended in 2014, and that pictures of the devices used in Lebanon suggested the batteries may have been swapped with explosive ones.\par \par \uc2 Observers have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/sep/18/explosions-linked-to-walkie-talkies-deaths-lebanon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said the attacks}}}\uc2  on Wednesday, which killed 20 people and injured at least 450 in cities across Lebanon the day after exploding pagers killed at least 12 people and injured several thousand, may constitute a war crime. World leaders and diplomats have warned that the attacks, which have been blamed on Israel, could trigger all-out war between Israel and \uc2 Hezbollah\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What is the aim of the attacks? The strategic goal is unclear, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2024/sep/19/lebanon-blasts-impossible-to-know-if-walkie-talkies-used-by-hezbollah-were-from-our-company-says-japanese-firm-live?page=with:block-66ebd5018f08c4c724a409e9#block-66ebd5018f08c4c724a409e9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to Guardian security expert Dan Sabbagh}}}\uc2 , though they could have been a provocation for escalation.\par \par \uc2 In other news \u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 A Republican senator has accused the female Muslim head of a thinktank of supporting \uc2 Hamas\uc2  and \uc2 Hezbollah\uc2  and told her to \u8220\'20\'1Chide your head in a bag\u8221\'20\'1D,\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/18/john-kennedy-senator-questioning-civil-rights-groups"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 during a congressional hearing}}}\uc2  on hate crimes.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Swedish children will begin school at six, a year earlier than currently,\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/sep/19/swedish-children-to-start-school-a-year-earlier-six"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in a shift away}}}\uc2  from the education system\u8217\'20\'19s focus on play for young children.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Teamsters union\uc2  has declined to endorse a candidate for president for the first time since 1996. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/18/election-teamsters-endorsement-harris-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Published data suggests}}}\uc2  the majority of its members back \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Stat of the day: Americans pay nearly double for healthcare compared with peer nations \u8211\'20\'13 but the US system ranks last\par \par \uc2 The US health system {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.co.uk/us-news/2024/sep/18/american-health-system-ranks-last"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 came last in a global ranking of 10 peer nations}}}\uc2 , according to a report by the \uc2 Commonwealth Fund\uc2 , which compared it with Australia, Canada, France, Germany, the Netherlands, New Zealand, the UK, Sweden and Switzerland. The US system performed poorly on health equity, access to care and outcomes \u8211\'20\'13 despite Americans paying almost double that of other countries.\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss this: Amber Thurman was killed by Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. There will be others\par \par \uc2 Amber Thurman died just weeks after Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban went into effect. The 28-year-old was a mother to a six-year-old and had dreams of becoming a nurse. Her death in August 2022 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/sep/19/georgia-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 meant she was the first woman }}}\uc2  to die a preventable, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related death in the wake of Dobbs. Thurman had taken \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills in another state, and Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban meant doctors were banned from carrying out a simple, 15-minute procedure to treat her miscarriage when the process went wrong. \u8220\'20\'1CEvery life \u8211\'20\'13 every woman\u8217\'20\'19s life \u8211\'20\'13 is a world of possibility: these murders by neglect to which the law sentences women like Amber exterminate those worlds,\u8221\'20\'1D writes Moira Donegan.\par \par \uc2 Climate check: Storm Boris batters northern Italy, bringing severe flooding and landslides\par \par \uc2 Storm Boris has killed 24 people in central and eastern Europe since last week and is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/sep/18/storm-boris-batters-northern-italy-bringing-severe-flooding-and-landslides"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 now lashing the northern Italian region}}}\uc2  of Emilia-Romagna, triggering severe flooding and landslides. The EU\u8217\'20\'19s crisis management commissioner, \uc2 Janez Lenarcic\uc2 , said of the extreme weather: \u8220\'20\'1CMake no mistake. This tragedy is not an anomaly. This is fast becoming the norm for our shared future. Europe is the fastest warming continent globally and is particularly vulnerable to extreme weather events.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Last Thing: How to win at canapes \u8211\'20\'13 Edith Pritchett on being hungry at a party\par \par \uc2 If you\u8217\'20\'19ve ever been at a wedding where the canapes are just out of reach, gone before the tray has reached the area where you\u8217\'20\'19re mingling \u8211\'20\'13 fear not! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguaridan.co.uk/lifeandstyle/picture/2024/sep/21/how-to-win-at-canapes-edith-pritchett-on-being-hungry-at-a-do"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Edith Pritchett is here to teach you how}}}\uc2  to snake out of the no-canape-zone and into the premium canape zone, where all manner of crostini await you.\par \par \uc2 Sign up\par \par \uc2 First Thing is delivered to thousands of inboxes every weekday. If you\u8217\'20\'19re not already signed up, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/info/2018/sep/17/guardian-us-morning-briefing-sign-up-to-stay-informed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 subscribe now}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Get in touch\par \par \uc2 If you have any questions or comments about any of our newsletters please email {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:newsletters@theguardian.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 newsletters@theguardian.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240919ek9j001jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
