\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2  and German rightwing aristocrat linked to US anti- \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  activist\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 948 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 September 2024\par 10:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  justice and Gloria von Thurn und Taxis found to have rubbed elbows with hardliner \uc2 Leonard Leo\par \par \uc2 The supreme court justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2  and a German aristocrat and \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/13/alito-supreme-court-far-right-ties"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 networker of the far right}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D from whom Alito accepted expensive concert tickets, are both linked to an ultra-conservative Catholic US group whose board members include the dark money impresario \uc2 Leonard Leo\uc2  and the founder of a hardline anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Christian group, documentation reviewed by the Guardian shows.\par \par \uc2 In 2018, Gloria von Thurn und Taxis, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/07/world/europe/princess-gloria-von-thurn-und-taxis-francis.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the New York Times}}}\uc2  about attending a dinner hosted in Rome by James Harvey, an American cardinal and hardliner, and sponsored by the Napa Institute, a group founded by Timothy R Busch, a conservative Catholic businessman and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/acts-of-faith/wp/2017/03/17/heres-what-i-saw-when-i-attended-a-conservative-catholic-gathering-in-dcs-trump-tower/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 political activist}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Leo, 59, is an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/18/bud-light-boycott-funding"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 activist}}}\uc2  and fundraiser who worked on the confirmations of all six rightwing justices who now dominate the supreme court, Alito among them. Now controlling billions of dollars in funding for rightwing groups, Leo is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.propublica.org/nonprofits/organizations/831067468/202343079349301249/full"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 director}}}\uc2  of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.napalegalinstitute.org/board/leonard-leo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Napa Institute Legal Foundation}}}\uc2 , also known as Napa Legal Institute, and the Napa Institute Support Foundation.\par \par \uc2 Also among Napa Legal Institute {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.napalegalinstitute.org/board/alan-sears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 directors}}}\uc2  is \uc2 Alan Sears\uc2 , founder of the \uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2 . The \uc2 ADF\uc2  was the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://adflegal.org/case/dobbs-v-jackson-womens-health-organization"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 principal driver}}}\uc2  of Dobbs v Jackson Women\u8217\'20\'19s Health Organization, the case in which the supreme court ended the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with Alito writing the ruling handed down in June 2022.\par \par \uc2 In 2017, the Napa Institute hosted a two-day symposium at the Trump hotel in Washington, during which Alito attended a dinner.\par \par \uc2 Writing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/acts-of-faith/wp/2017/03/17/heres-what-i-saw-when-i-attended-a-conservative-catholic-gathering-in-dcs-trump-tower/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 for the Washington Post}}}\uc2 , John Gehring, an author and reporter, said the symposium \u8220\'20\'1Cmixed traditional Catholic religious practices with moments that felt uncomfortably nationalistic\u8221\'20\'1D, including a \u8220\'20\'1Creading in the rosary booklet from [the Confederate general] Robert E Lee that [seemed] \u8230\'20\'26 stunningly insensitive at best \u8230\'20\'26 at a time when the \u8216\'20\'18alt-right\u8217\'20\'19 and white nationalism are basking in the glow of renewed attention and proximity to power\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Alito is not the only supreme court justice with links to the Napa Institute. In September 2021, as part of a series sponsored by the group, Justice \uc2 Clarence Thomas{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ncronline.org/news/politics/notre-dame-clarence-thomas-criticizes-judges-veering-politics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spoke}}}\uc2  at the \uc2 University of Notre Dame\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe court was thought to be the least dangerous branch and we may have become the most dangerous,\u8221\'20\'1D Thomas said, attacking judges he deemed to be \u8220\'20\'1Cventuring into areas we should not have entered into\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 meaning politics.\par \par \uc2 Thomas and Alito, however, have been the subject of numerous reports about undeclared gifts from rightwing donors, fueling an ethics crisis now stoked by news of Alito\u8217\'20\'19s acceptance of concert tickets valued at $900 from von Thurn und Taxis.\par \par \uc2 Von Thurn und Taxis, 64, is a former punk turned billionaire, also known as Princess TNT, with close links to the far-right Alternative f\u252\'00\'FCr Deutschland (AfD) party. News of her gift to Alito was accompanied by reporting of further links between the two, including a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/briansbrown/status/1189213352167428096?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1189213352167428096%7Ctwgr%5Ed2691afa0d3db3d7631b5cddf91363fd03d10009%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.motherjones.com%2Fpolitics%2F2019%2F11%2Fa-german-princess-a-cardinal-and-an-anti-lgbt-activist-walk-into-the-supreme-court%2F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 picture}}}\uc2  of Alito and another rightwing justice, \uc2 Brett Kavanaugh\uc2 , posing at the supreme court in 2019 with the German socialite; Cardinal Gerhard Ludwig M\u252\'00\'FCller, a German hardliner; and Brian Brown, a prominent US anti-LGBTQ+ campaigner.\par \par \uc2 Von Thurn und Taxis {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.n-tv.de/politik/Gloria-von-Thurn-und-Taxis-beschenkte-US-Richter-Alito-article25211675.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told German media}}}\uc2  that Alito and his wife, Martha-Ann, attended a concert at her castle in Bavaria last year as \u8220\'20\'1Cprivate friends\u8221\'20\'1D. In emails to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/13/alito-supreme-court-far-right-ties"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Guardian}}}\uc2 , the aristocrat clarified: \u8220\'20\'1CWe never speak about politics nor religion at the table, because we believe it limits the possibility to make friends.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The socialite, who rejects the label \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/13/alito-supreme-court-far-right-ties"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 networker of the far right}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D, also said it would \u8220\'20\'1Cnever occur\u8221\'20\'1D to her to speak about \u8220\'20\'1Ctouchy subjects\u8221\'20\'1D like \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  with someone she knew socially, and claimed not to know that \u8220\'20\'1Cthe Dobbs decision\u8221\'20\'1D referred to the supreme court \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights ruling written by Alito.\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z8fyq2ar9CQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speech}}}\uc2  at the National Conservatism Conference in Brussels last April, von Thurn und Taxis said European leaders were \u8220\'20\'1Cfinanc[ing] the killing of our offspring\u8221\'20\'1D in an apparent reference to the availability of reproductive rights in Europe. She added: \u8220\'20\'1CDoes this make any sense? Is there some kind of racism? Are we not supposed to reproduce?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Alito and his wife have also been outspoken about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other hot-button cultural issues. In June, the progressive activist Lauren Windsor released recordings in which Justice Alito {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/06/12/politics/alito-supreme-court-tape-analysis/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 agreed}}}\uc2  that the US should \u8220\'20\'1Creturn \u8230\'20\'26 to a place of godliness\u8221\'20\'1D and said, \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t know that we can negotiate with the left\u8221\'20\'1D. Regarding her supposed persecution from those on the left, his wife {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.rollingstone.com/politics/politics-features/supreme-court-martha-ann-alito-pride-flags-left-media-1235037338/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CLook at me, look at me. I\u8217\'20\'19m German. I\u8217\'20\'19m from Germany. My heritage is German. You come after me, I\u8217\'20\'19m gonna give it back to you.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Caroline Ciccone, president of Accountable.US, which campaigns for court reform and which highlighted links between the German socialite, the Napa Institute and Alito, said: \u8220\'20\'1CWhen a supreme court justice like \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2  pals around with influential rightwing figures like Princess Gloria von Thurn und Taxis and \uc2 Leonard Leo\uc2 , it raises concerns about fairness and impartiality.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThese relationships aren\u8217\'20\'19t just about gifts. They reflect a deeper effort to manipulate our legal system in ways that could impact the rights of everyday people.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ciccone added, \u8220\'20\'1CWhat\u8217\'20\'19s disturbing is that this happens behind closed doors \u8211\'20\'13 at parties at the Bavarian castle \u8211\'20\'13 away from public scrutiny. We\u8217\'20\'19re talking about relationships that can affect everything, from reproductive rights to environmental protections\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 both the subject of recent supreme court rulings widely seen as victories for the political right.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe American people deserve a judiciary that serves justice impartially,\u8221\'20\'1D Ciccone said, \u8220\'20\'1Cnot one that can be bought.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240917ek9h0015t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
