\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Harris was strongest at debate when talking about  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  while Trump relied on tired old lies\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 1,006 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 September 2024\par 16:53 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Harris spoke passionately about women\u8217\'20\'19s personal experiences post-Roe, as Trump repeated his usual extreme rhetoricUS politics live \u8211\'20\'13 latest updates\par \par \uc2 Throughout his 2024 campaign for president, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  has avoided giving straight, consistent or accurate answers to questions about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 and in his first debate appearance against \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , Trump kept up that streak.\par \par \uc2 Moderators introduced \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , one of the biggest issues in the election, by asking about the most recent example of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s incoherence on the topic: his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/aug/30/trump-ivf-anti-abortion-groups"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 position on a Florida ballot measure}}}\uc2  that would enshrine \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights into the state\u8217\'20\'19s constitution. Over the last few weeks, Trump initially suggested that he would vote in favor of the measure \u8211\'20\'13 which would restore \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in a state that has banned the procedure past six weeks of pregnancy \u8211\'20\'13 before quickly backtracking amid outrage from his anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  base.\par \par \uc2 Asked to explain his flip-flop, Trump said: \u8220\'20\'1CThe reason I\u8217\'20\'19m doing that vote \u8211\'20\'13 because the plan is \u8211\'20\'13 you know the vote is \u8211\'20\'13 they have \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the ninth month.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Less than a fraction of a percentage point of abortions take place after the 21st week of pregnancy. Executing a baby after birth, which Trump repeatedly accused Democrats of supporting, would be infanticide and it is illegal in all 50 states \u8211\'20\'13 as noted by the ABC News moderator Linsey Davis in a fact-check after he spoke.\par \par \uc2 When pressed on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Trump has long pivoted to making outlandish claims about killing babies. In his final debate against \uc2 Hillary Clinton\uc2  during the 2016 presidential campaign, he claimed that \u8220\'20\'1Cyou can rip the baby out of the womb in the ninth month on the final day\u8221\'20\'1D. That kind of gruesome rhetoric proved useful for Trump at the time, as leaders of the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thecut.com/article/marjorie-dannenfelser-abortion-roe-v-wade.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cheered him on}}}\uc2  and ultimately helped put him in the White House.\par \par \uc2 In a post-Roe nation where most people support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, however, that rhetoric hits differently.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe accusations of extremism are a lot less effective when your own party is aligned with the movement that most Americans are perceiving as extreme,\u8221\'20\'1D said Mary Ziegler, a professor at the \uc2 University of California, Davis\uc2  who studies the legal history of reproduction.\par \par \uc2 Trump also claimed that \u8220\'20\'1Cevery legal scholar, every Democrat, every Republican, every liberal, conservative \u8211\'20\'13 they all wanted this issue to be brought back to these states\u8221\'20\'1D. In reality, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2022/07/06/majority-of-public-disapproves-of-supreme-courts-decision-to-overturn-roe-v-wade/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than 60% of Americans disapproved}}}\uc2  of the decision to overturn Roe. Support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/may/14/abortion-rights-support-poll"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surged since Roe\u8217\'20\'19s demise}}}\uc2 , including in red states.\par \par \uc2 For Harris, meanwhile, the topic of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  yielded some of her strongest moments in a debate already full of strong moments. She spoke passionately about women bleeding out from miscarriages unable to get care, victims of rape forced to carry unwanted pregnancies. \uc2 Celinda Lake\uc2 , a veteran Democratic pollster, saw Harris\u8217\'20\'19s comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the moment the debate snapped into place for the vice-president.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe opening was a little more mixed,\u8221\'20\'1D Lake said. \u8220\'20\'1CI think Trump made a strong case on the economy but she just knocked it out of the park on the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  stuff.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 During her turn to speak, Harris appeared to reference the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/sections/health-shots/2023/04/25/1171851775/oklahoma-woman-abortion-ban-study-shows-confusion-at-hospitals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 case of Jaci Statton}}}\uc2 , a woman who was told by Oklahoma hospital staffers that they could not end her nonviable pregnancy and to instead wait in a hospital parking lot until she was \u8220\'20\'1Ccrashing\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShe\u8217\'20\'19s bleeding out in the car in the parking lot,\u8221\'20\'1D Harris said. \u8220\'20\'1CShe didn\u8217\'20\'19t want that. Her husband didn\u8217\'20\'19t want that. A 12- or 13-year-old survivor of incest being forced to carry a pregnancy to term? They don\u8217\'20\'19t want that.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Tresa Undem, who\u8217\'20\'19s been polling people on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for decades, thought the way Harris talked about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \u8220\'20\'1Cunprecedented\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFor undecided women and undecided independent men, I think it was pretty powerful and it can have an effect,\u8221\'20\'1D Undem said. \u8220\'20\'1CShe reminded folks, including undecided voters, that most Americans are with her. Most Americans believe that women should have control over their own body \u8230\'20\'26 And she landed on freedom, which is a value that everybody cares about.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump, meanwhile, repeatedly ducked efforts to commit to vetoing a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban and baldly rejected comments made by JD Vance, his running mate, who said that Trump would veto such a ban.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWell, I didn\u8217\'20\'19t discuss it with JD, in all fairness,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said.\par \par \uc2 Harris, too, was evasive in moments \u8211\'20\'13 when asked directly if she would support any restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , she reiterated her longstanding promise to support legislation to codify Roe into law, even though Roe didn\u8217\'20\'19t stop states from enacting the restrictions that hacked away at access to the procedure. (It is also unlikely that Congress would pass such a bill anytime soon.) In an interview after the debate, Harris\u8217\'20\'19s pick for vice-president, \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2 , also dodged questions about restrictions his boss may support.\par \par \uc2 In the weeks since Harris became the Democratic nominee for president, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  has become an increasingly key issue for women. A recent \uc2 New York Times\uc2  poll found that, among all women, it now rivals the economy in terms of importance and is the top voting issue among women under 45. A Harris campaign representative {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.rollingstone.com/politics/politics-news/harris-destroys-trump-abortion-debate-1235099498/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Rolling Stone}}}\uc2  that in the first hour of the debate, 71% of grassroots donors to the campaign were women.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think she litigated it just spectacularly well,\u8221\'20\'1D Lake said. \u8220\'20\'1CTwo-thirds of the impact of the debate are the press interpretations afterward and the press has been even more positive. When you have Fox News criticizing Trump and saying there should be another debate, you know you\u8217\'20\'19ve won.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Read more about the 2024 US election:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/sep/10/harris-trump-debate-fact-check-updates"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fact-checking the presidential debate}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/sep/11/trump-harris-presidential-debate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Harris slams Trump for falsehoods in fiery debate}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/sep/11/taylor-swift-endorses-kamala-harris-president-us-debate-cat-lady"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Taylor Swift endorses Harris in post signed \u8216\'20\'18childless cat lady\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/sep/10/trump-harris-debate-reaction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Maga mad libs\u8217\'20\'19: How the debate played out on social media}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/aug/23/presidential-polls-kamala-harris-donald-trump-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Presidential poll tracker}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240911ek9b001xh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
