\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Elizabeth Warren condemns Trump for \u8216\'20\'18changing his tune\u8217\'20\'19 on IVF\b0\par\par\uc2 Edward Helmore \par \uc2 478 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 August 2024\par 20:23 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Democratic senator says Republican nominee trying to have it \u8216\'20\'18both ways\u8217\'20\'19 and adapting position to his audience\par \par \uc2 The US senator {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/elizabeth-warren"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elizabeth Warren}}}\uc2  has accused \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  of trying to have it \u8220\'20\'1Cboth ways\u8221\'20\'1D with in vitro fertilization (IVF), two days after the former president vowed to force health insurance companies or the federal government to pay for the treatments if he is elected in November.\par \par \uc2 Speaking on MSNBC, Warren said Trump was simply adapting his positions according to what he perceived his audience\u8217\'20\'19s preference to be.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSo when he thinks he\u8217\'20\'19s talking to his radical base, he says: how radical do you need for me to be?\u8221\'20\'1D Warren, a Massachusetts Democrat, said Saturday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  will go there and go further. But when he\u8217\'20\'19s talking to the overwhelming majority of Americans, who very much oppose that radical approach to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and IVF, he tries to change his tune, and then is shocked when each side now is starting to call him out on that.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Republican nominee for November\u8217\'20\'19s presidential election has recast his position on IVF as a strong supporter of the pricey treatment \u8211\'20\'13 a characterization Democrats reject, accusing him of shifting his position only after US voters signaled broad support for reproductive rights.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Democrats accuse Trump of shifting his position on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. On Friday, he said he would vote against a ballot measure in his home state of Florida that would protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights beyond six weeks after facing backlash from conservative supporters.\par \par \uc2 A day earlier, Trump upset anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists when he told NBC News that he supported the measure. \u8220\'20\'1CYou need more time than six weeks,\u8221\'20\'1D said Trump, who has repeatedly boasted about how his three appointees on the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  created a conservative supermajority which eliminated federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in 2022.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19ve disagreed with that right from the early primaries when I heard about it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  issued a statement saying her opponent \u8220\'20\'1Cjust made his position on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  very clear\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe will vote to uphold an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban so extreme it applies before many women even know they are pregnant,\u8221\'20\'1D Harris said.\par \par \uc2 On Saturday, Warren accused Trump of playing games on IVF.\par \par \uc2 She said: \u8220\'20\'1CAre you kidding me? He also supports \u8211\'20\'13 and it\u8217\'20\'19s also there in his platform \u8211\'20\'13 that IVF will effectively be banned all across the United States. Sorry, Donald, can\u8217\'20\'19t have it both ways.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Warren also accused the former president of lacking principles \u8211\'20\'13 which is why, she said, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/26/elizabeth-warren-jd-vance-nationwide-abortion-ban-veto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 women do not trust him}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere\u8217\'20\'19s no principle here for him other than, \u8216\'20\'18Does it help \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 ?\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D Warren said. \u8220\'20\'1CThat is his single guiding principle, and American women are just flat calling him out on that and saying we are not going to trust \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240831ek8v002be\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
