\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Women are not stupid\u8217\'20\'19: Warren dismisses Vance\u8217\'20\'19s promise on  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban veto\b0\par\par\uc2 Ramon Antonio Vargas \par \uc2 657 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 August 2024\par 09:37 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 US senator Elizabeth Warren says women do not trust JD Vance\u8217\'20\'19s pledge that Trump would veto nationwide ban if elected\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/elizabeth-warren"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elizabeth Warren}}}\uc2  says \u8220\'20\'1CAmerican women are not stupid\u8221\'20\'1D and therefore do not believe JD Vance\u8217\'20\'19s promise that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  would veto any nationwide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban passed by Congress if the Republican presidential ticket wins November\u8217\'20\'19s election.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAmerican women are not stupid, and we are not going to trust the futures of our daughters and granddaughters to two men who have openly bragged about blocking access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for women all across this country,\u8221\'20\'1D Warren said on Sunday on NBC\u8217\'20\'19s Meet the Press.\par \par \uc2 The Democratic US senator from Massachusetts added that she suspects conservative activists could use the Comstock Act, a 19th-century anti-obscenity law which bans mailing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related materials, to enforce a federal ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the former president clinches a second presidency with Vance as his running mate. She said it would not be all that \u8220\'20\'1Chard to accomplish\u8221\'20\'1D with \u8220\'20\'1Cthe right person [in] the Department of Justice and one of their extremist judges out in the world\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUnderstand this: today 30% of all women live in states that effectively ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Warren said, referring to how {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/jul/29/abortion-laws-bans-by-state"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 14 US states}}}\uc2  have enacted near-total bans on the procedure since the 2022 \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ruling that eliminated federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and JD Vance in the White House \u8211\'20\'13 it won\u8217\'20\'19t be 30%. It\u8217\'20\'19ll be 100%.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Warren\u8217\'20\'19s remarks came in response to a separate Meet the Press interview with Vance in which he was asked whether Trump, if elected again to the Oval Office, would use the presidency\u8217\'20\'19s veto powers overrule a congressional federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think he would,\u8221\'20\'1D Vance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/MeetThePress/status/1827473548853616804"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Meet the Press host Kristen Welker in a pre-recorded clip which the show began promoting on Saturday. \u8220\'20\'1CHe said \u8230\'20\'26 explicitly that he would.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump himself pledged in April that he would not sign a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban into law, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/religion/fact-sheet/public-opinion-on-abortion/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 polling}}}\uc2  showing a clear majority of Americans favor \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  being legal in all or most cases. But Democrats maintain that he is lying.\par \par \uc2 They point out that Trump has spoken proudly of his three supreme court appointees who formed part of the conservative majority that dissolved the federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights previously established by the Roe v Wade decision in 1973.\par \par \uc2 And they note how the 900-page Project 2025 plan drafted by a conservative thinktank that supports Trump calls for the Food and Drug Administration to completely revoke its approval of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication mifepristone.\par \par \uc2 Project 2025 also discusses using the Comstock Act to criminally prosecute people who send \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills or tools through the mail. Vance in 2023 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/26/jd-vance-abortion-ban-travel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 joined}}}\uc2  40 of his fellow Republican lawmakers calling on US justice department prosecutors to investigate pursuing physicians, pharmacists and others \u8220\'20\'1Cwho break the federal mail-order \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In June, Warren \u8211\'20\'13 a 2020 Democratic presidential primary candidate \u8211\'20\'13 helped introduce legislation aiming to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/20/comstock-act-democrats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 repeal the Comstock Act}}}\uc2 . It has not garnered the 60 votes necessary to advance bills in the Senate. But part of the proposed bill\u8217\'20\'19s strategy was to raise awareness of the Comstock Act\u8217\'20\'19s consequences for the 168 million women living in the US \u8211\'20\'13 a country of 333 million.\par \par \uc2 According to Warren on Sunday, the only way to protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access in the US was to elect the Democratic nominee, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , over Trump \u8211\'20\'13 as well as a Congress with a clear liberal majority that would pass laws enshrining the right to access \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related care nationwide.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShe will sign it into law,\u8221\'20\'1D Warren said. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd then we will restore a right to half the population in this country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 The headline and introduction of this article were amended on 27 and 29 August 2024 to more accurately reflect Elizabeth Warren\u8217\'20\'19s quote.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240826ek8q001jq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
