\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Trump hails RFK Jr as \u8216\'20\'18great person\u8217\'20\'19 after 2024 endorsement \u8211\'20\'13 as it happened\b0\par\par\uc2 Sam Levin, Maya Yang and L\u233\'00\'E9onie Chao-Fong \par \uc2 8,426 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 August 2024\par 01:20 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 This blog is now closed. You can read our latest story hereRFK Jr suspends US campaign and endorses TrumpRFK Jr\u8217\'20\'19s wildest campaign momentsHis voters react: \u8216\'20\'18He\u8217\'20\'19s playing politics\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 2.16am BST\par \par \uc2 Summary\par \par \uc2 That\u8217\'20\'19s all the live coverage for the day, thanks for following along. Some key developments from the day:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/robert-f-kennedy-jr-drops-out-endorses-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suspended his campaign and endorsed Donald Trump}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Kennedy gave a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/aug/23/dnc-kamala-harris-trump-rfk-campaign-election-updates?page=with:block-66c8dd838f0855397f4aeda9#block-66c8dd838f0855397f4aeda9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rambling speech}}}\uc2  about his decision to support the GOP nominee and later {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/aug/23/dnc-kamala-harris-trump-rfk-campaign-election-updates?page=with:block-66c91e4b8f0858e1c86999c4#block-66c91e4b8f0858e1c86999c4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 appeared}}}\uc2  with Trump at a rally in Arizona.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Five of Kennedy\u8217\'20\'19s siblings released a statement {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/aug/23/dnc-kamala-harris-trump-rfk-campaign-election-updates?page=with:block-66c8e0eb8f089e7649975965#block-66c8e0eb8f089e7649975965"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 denouncing their brother\u8217\'20\'19s decision}}}\uc2  to endorse Trump.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 A county judge in Ohio temporarily {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/ohio-24-hour-abortion-waiting-period-blocked"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blocked}}}\uc2  several state laws on Friday that combined to create a 24-hour waiting period for obtaining an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Democratic national convention speech {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/trump-reaction-harris-dnc-speech"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 provoked a torrent of outrage from Trump}}}\uc2  as the former US president fired off a volley of ripostes, rebuttals and angry calls to TV stations.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 US polls suggest Harris is making {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/aug/23/presidential-polls-kamala-harris-donald-trump-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gains on Trump in national averages}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 An Arizona man who was wanted after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/donald-trump-man-arrested-threat"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 threatening over social media to kill Donald Trump}}}\uc2  was arrested on Thursday, the Cochise county sheriff\u8217\'20\'19s office said.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The inclusion by the \uc2 Democratic National Committee\uc2  of a hostage family but not a representative of the Palestinian community {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/like-a-rollercoaster-palestinian-americans-clamour-to-be-heard-at-dnc-convention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 provoked exasperation}}}\uc2  over the inequities surrounding the program at the Democratic party\u8217\'20\'19s biggest show.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 1.46am BST\par \par \uc2 Arizona man arrested for alleged threats against Trump\par \par \uc2 A 66-year-old Arizona man has been arrested for allegedly making death threats on social media against \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , officials said.\par \par \uc2 Ronald Lee Syvrud was taken into custody on Thursday afternoon, officials with the Cochise county sheriff\u8217\'20\'19s office said on Friday, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/us/arizona-man-arrested-after-threatening-kill-trump-sheriffs-office-says-2024-08-24/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Reuters reports}}}\uc2 . Syvrud was booked into the county\u8217\'20\'19s jail on a felony warrant for \u8220\'20\'1Cfailure to register as a sex offender and two counts of threatening for this case\u8221\'20\'1D, the sheriff\u8217\'20\'19s office said, saying Syvrud had been arrested without incident. The sheriff\u8217\'20\'19s department hasn\u8217\'20\'19t specified the exact nature of the threat, but {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.facebook.com/CochiseSO/posts/pfbid0fpEVUKbMLK2SX3kA1H3gHRAVHBvZ6fSRAibv21ACsTJvxcvMkGoeLuz8coWDf7Gwl"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in a statement on Thursday that Syvrud\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cthreatening message\u8221\'20\'1D had included \u8220\'20\'1Clanguage that indicated bodily harm to the candidate\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 When Trump was asked about the alleged threat while campaigning, the former president said: \u8220\'20\'1CI am not that surprised and the reason is because I want to do things that are very bad for the bad guys.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump is currently speaking in Glendale, Arizona.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, the US attorney\u8217\'20\'19s office {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.commercialappeal.com/story/news/local/2024/08/23/kyl-hall-charged-threats-kamala-harris-obama-biden/74921136007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  that a Memphis-area man was charged with threatening high-profile Democrats. Kyl Alton Hall, 37, \u8220\'20\'1Cthreatened to kill, assassinate, shoot, and crash the plane of President Biden; assassinate Vice President Harris; and assassinate former President Obama\u8221\'20\'1D, prosecutors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.justice.gov/usao-wdtn/pr/man-charged-threats-against-president-vice-president-and-former-president"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 1.48am BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 1.04am BST\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2  have briefly rallied together in Glendale, Arizona, tonight, repeatedly noting that they don\u8217\'20\'19t agree on all issues, but claiming to be united on some matters, including wanting a \u8220\'20\'1Chealthy nation\u8221\'20\'1D. Kennedy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/robert-f-kennedy-jr-drops-out-endorses-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said earlier today}}}\uc2  that he and Trump agreed on fighting against \u8220\'20\'1Cthe war on our children\u8221\'20\'1D, a phrase covering Kennedy\u8217\'20\'19s widely criticized opposition to vaccines, which has been rooted in conspiracy theories.\par \par \uc2 Kennedy attempted a meld of their campaign messages, saying, vaguely: \u8220\'20\'1CDon\u8217\'20\'19t you want a president that is going to make America healthy again?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump also announced that \u8220\'20\'1Cin honor of Bobby\u8221\'20\'1D he would, if elected, \u8220\'20\'1Cestablish a new independent presidential commission on assassination attempts, and they will be tasked with releasing all of the remaining documents pertaining to the assassination of President \uc2 John F Kennedy\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D. He said this commission would also \u8220\'20\'1Cconduct a rigorous review\u8221\'20\'1D of his own assassination attempt.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 1.48am BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 12.46am BST\par \par \uc2 Trump rallies with RFK Jr: 'He went after me a couple times, I didn't like it'\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s introduction to \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2 , who suspended his campaign today:\par \par \uc2 I\u8217\'20\'19m very pleased to welcome a man who has been an incredible champion for so many of these values that we all share, and we\u8217\'20\'19ve shared them for a long time. I don\u8217\'20\'19t think too many of you people have heard of him. He\u8217\'20\'19s very low-key. He\u8217\'20\'19s a very low-key person, but he\u8217\'20\'19s highly respected. He is a great person. I\u8217\'20\'19ve known him for so long, for the past 16 months.\par \par \uc2 He also went after me a couple of times, and I didn\u8217\'20\'19t like it.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 12.21am BST\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is holding a rally in Glendale, Arizona\par \par \uc2 The Trump campaign\u8217\'20\'19s rally is under way in Glendale, Arizona, where temperatures have exceeded 100F (38C). The ABC15 local station is reporting that more than 100 people have been affected by heat exhaustion, some of whom have been treated and hospitalized for heat-related illnesses.\par \par \uc2 enltrUPDATE: Glendale Fire officials say more than 100 people needed to get checked out and/or transported to a hospital for heat exhaustion while waiting to get into Trump's campaign rally in Glendale this afternoon. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/XmlKFLsclU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/XmlKFLsclU}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 ABC15 Arizona (@abc15) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/abc15/status/1827113060449894874?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Fire officials told the local station:\par \par \uc2 We have evaluated, treated and transported to local medical facilities many individuals for various reasons which depleted our ability to respond in a timely manner.\par \par \uc2 enltrIt\u8217\'20\'19s 104 in Glendale - and many are still waiting outside to get into the Trump rally. Some people I talked to went home over heat concerns, another woman near me almost passed out in line, I\u8217\'20\'19m told multiple people have gone to the hospital (haven\u8217\'20\'19t been able to get solid #). {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/v1mwGYlamM"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/v1mwGYlamM}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Rachel Louise Just (@RLJnews) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/RLJnews/status/1827099292009689268?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Kari Lake, the far-right US senate candidate, is currently speaking and says the former president is due to follow.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 12.25am BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 12.08am BST\par \par \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2 , who suspended his campaign today and endorsed \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , is confirmed to have had his name removed from the ballots in Ohio, Arizona, Pennsylvania and Texas:\par \par \uc2 enltrRFK Jr. won\u8217\'20\'19t be on the ballot in Ohio after withdrawing his name, SoS says. That\u8217\'20\'19s now Arizona, Pennsylvania and Texas where Kennedy has asked to not appear on the ballot so far. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/69eTcY6GLZ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/69eTcY6GLZ}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Meryl Kornfield (@MerylKornfield) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MerylKornfield/status/1827107614226092489?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 12.27am BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 11.22pm BST\par \par \uc2 Ohio judge blocks \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  waiting period\par \par \uc2 A county judge in Ohio {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/abortion-ohio-waiting-period-lawsuit-0c1d454ee30a6c72a5ee80f7734e2592"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has blocked}}}\uc2  several state laws that created a 24-hour waiting period for accessing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care in the state.\par \par \uc2 David C Young, the Franklin county court of common pleas judge, cited a 2023 constitutional amendment that guarantees access to the procedure.\par \par \uc2 He found \u8220\'20\'1Cthat the challenged statutes burden, penalize, prohibit, interfere with, and discriminate against patients in exercising their right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and providers for assisting them in exercising that right\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Dave Yost\uc2 , the Republican attorney general, said he would appeal.\par \par \uc2 Amendments involving \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access will be on the ballot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kff.org/womens-health-policy/dashboard/ballot-tracker-status-of-abortion-related-state-constitutional-amendment-measures/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in 12 states}}}\uc2  this election, according to the \uc2 Kaiser Family Foundation\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 For more on the Ohio law, read Alice Herman for the Guardian:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/nov/17/ohio-abortion-rights-republicans-overturn"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ohio voted to protect \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights. Republicans are scheming to undo it}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 11.34pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 11.00pm BST\par \par \uc2 ActBlue, the Democratic fundraising platform, announced today that it had processed more than $100 m in donations during the Democratic national convention this week.\par \par \uc2 The platform added that it recorded $7.2m in donations during Harris\u8217\'20\'19s acceptance speech Thursday evening.\par \par \uc2 enltr??BIG {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/DNC2024?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #DNC2024}}}\uc2  NEWS:\par \par \uc2 ??As of 12:00 PM ET today, the ActBlue platform processed over $100 million in fundraising for Democrats across the country during {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/DemConvention?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #DemConvention}}}\uc2  week.\par \par \uc2 ??$7.2 million was raised between 11:00 PM and 12:00 AM ET alone during VP Harris' acceptance speech. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/WnC5XhayuB"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/WnC5XhayuB}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 ActBlue (@actblue) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/actblue/status/1827047846153187481?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Harris has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/us/harris-election-effort-raises-around-500-million-month-sources-say-2024-08-20/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raised $500m}}}\uc2  in the month since she took over as the Democratic candidate for president, Reuters reported earlier this week.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 11.32pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 10.31pm BST\par \par \uc2 'Terrible human being': RFK Jr's past comments on Trump\par \par \uc2 Like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/29/jd-vance-trump-comments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 JD Vance}}}\uc2 , the Republican vice-presidential nominee, \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2  previously condemned and insulted \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  on numerous occasions. With news of Kennedy withdrawing and endorsing the Republican, here\u8217\'20\'19s a look back at a few of his past quotes on the former president:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 According to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2024/08/12/robert-f-kennedy-jr-profile-presidential-campaign"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New Yorker story}}}\uc2  from earlier this month, Kennedy recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Lis_Smith/status/1827079402162725268"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  in a text message to someone that Trump is \u8220\'20\'1Ca terrible human being\u8221\'20\'1D, adding, \u8220\'20\'1CThe worse president ever and barely human. He is probably a sociopath.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 In April, after Trump accused Kennedy of being a \u8220\'20\'1CDemocratic plant\u8221\'20\'1D, Kennedy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/28/robert-kennedy-jr-trump-rant"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CWhen frightened men take to social media they risk descending into vitriol, which makes them sound unhinged. President Trump\u8217\'20\'19s rant against me is a barely coherent barrage of wild and inaccurate claims that should best be resolved in the American tradition of presidential debate.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 In 2020, Kennedy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/robert-kennedy-jr-on-donald-trump-142603057.html?guccounter=1&guce_referrer=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS8&guce_referrer_sig=AQAAADtgTS-tGG8BJhZX00_LiNuW9bX0lcvzOv4-5uHZumWS-w-kk9046lX_DiQ66JJKPOVXDBtvFP66Y27keaI3B7XQhHr4XnGP53GNVsqjQwqaBEYk3APARiPfhL78W-1COYy7fpq8zlKJNoeD-Chij3vaiIWFhv9CuAIts_sp9qnT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CHe is a bully. And you know, I don\u8217\'20\'19t like bullies. And I don\u8217\'20\'19t think... that that\u8217\'20\'19s part of America\u8217\'20\'19s tradition. I think, in many ways, he\u8217\'20\'19s discredited the American experiment with self-governance.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The former disdain goes both way. Trump earlier this year {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/liberal-lunatic-respect-trumps-stance-rfk-jr-evolved/story?id=113105050"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called Kennedy}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cone of the most Liberal Lunatics ever to run for office\u8221\'20\'1D, adding, \u8220\'20\'1CReminds me of this fly that\u8217\'20\'19s driving me crazy up here. This fly is brutal. I don\u8217\'20\'19t like flies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 10.46pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 10.29pm BST\par \par \uc2 Cheryl Hines, RFK Jr's wife, thanks supporters 'from all parties'\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr\u8217\'20\'19s wife, actor Cheryl Hines, tweeted about her husband\u8217\'20\'19s decision to suspend his presidential campaign this afternoon, thanking the campaign\u8217\'20\'19s staff for helping Kennedy overcome \u8220\'20\'1Cthe roadblocks and lawsuits that have been brought against them\u8221\'20\'1D :\par \par \uc2 I\u8217\'20\'19d like to extend a sincere, deeply heartfelt thank you to every person who has worked so tirelessly and lovingly on his campaign. \u8230\'20\'26 Over the last year and a half, I have met some extraordinary people from all parties \u8211\'20\'13 Democrats, Republicans, and Independents. It\u8217\'20\'19s been my experience that the vast majority of all parties are truly good people who want the best for our country and for each other. It has been an eye-opening, transformative, and endearing journey.\par \par \uc2 enltrThe decision has been made to suspend my husband's, \uc2 Robert Kennedy Jr.\uc2 's, presidency and I'd like to extend a sincere, deeply heartfelt thank you to every person who has worked so tirelessly and lovingly on his campaign. They have accomplished feats that were said to be\u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Cheryl Hines (@CherylHines) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CherylHines/status/1827065345255076291?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Hines, who\u8217\'20\'19s known for her role on the sitcom Curb Your Enthusiasm, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/aug/23/dnc-kamala-harris-trump-rfk-campaign-election-updates?page=with:block-66c892258f089e7649975435#block-66c892258f089e7649975435"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly}}}\uc2  opposed RFK Jr\u8217\'20\'19s decision to endorse Trump.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 10.32pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 9.46pm BST\par \par \uc2 Brain worm and a dead bear: RFK Jr's campaign controversies\par \par \uc2 The decision by \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2  to suspend his presidential campaign brings to an end one of the most bizarre campaigns of recent times.\par \par \uc2 Kennedy, who introduced the general public to the concept of \u8220\'20\'1Cleaky brain\u8221\'20\'1D and the idea that chemicals in water were making children transgender, initially ran for the Democratic nomination but {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/oct/09/robert-f-kennedy-jr-independent-run-2024-us-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched}}}\uc2  an independent campaign in October 2023.\par \par \uc2 His efforts failed to gain traction but left the public with some unusual, and some unsavory, memories.\par \par \uc2 The scandals include revelations he dropped off a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/05/rfk-jr-kennedy-bear-story-central-park-new-york"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dead bear}}}\uc2  in Central Park; his claim that part of his brain had been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/may/08/robert-f-kennedy-jr-worm-brain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eaten by a worm}}}\uc2  ; an alleged photo he took of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vanityfair.com/news/story/robert-kennedy-jr-shocking-history"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 barbecued dog}}}\uc2  ; conspiracy theories about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politifact.com/article/2023/jul/10/rfk-jrs-wi-fi-claim-about-human-blood-brain-barrie/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wifi radiation}}}\uc2  ; and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/02/robert-f-kennedy-jr-sexual-assault-allegation-response"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allegations of sexual assault}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Read more here for a detailed recounting of the most notable controversies:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/rfk-jr-wildest-campaign-moments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 RFK Jr\u8217\'20\'19s wildest campaign moments \u8211\'20\'13 from brain worms to barbecue dogs}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 9.23pm BST\par \par \uc2 Trump mocks Harris for saying 'thank you' to convention audience\par \par \uc2 After ranting live on Truth Social during \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Democratic national convention speech last night, Trump couldn\u8217\'20\'19t seem to shake it today. During an event at a Las Vegas restaurant, the former president complained about Harris\u8217\'20\'19s speech, falsely claiming she had made no mention of the border and mocking her for repeatedly thanking the audience.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShe mentioned \u8216\'20\'18thank you\u8217\'20\'19 about 50 times,\u8221\'20\'1D said Trump. \u8220\'20\'1CThank you, thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you,\u8221\'20\'1D he said, making a guttural noise possibly for dramatic effect and then continuing to repeat the word: \u8220\'20\'1CThank you, thank you, thank you, thank \u8211\'20\'13 thank, thank.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat the hell is wrong with her?\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 The Harris campaign immediately posted the clip:\par \par \uc2 enltrTrump: She mentioned 'thank you' about 50 times. Thank you, thank you, thank you. What the hell is wrong with her? She talked about her family {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/xAE34DBdao"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/xAE34DBdao}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Kamala HQ (@KamalaHQ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KamalaHQ/status/1827072120687321171?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 9.34pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 9.00pm BST\par \par \uc2 Interim summary\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a look at where things stand:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr announced the suspension of his presidential campaign and his endorsement of \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 . In a nearly 50-minute address, the independent candidate cited his endorsement reasons as \u8220\'20\'1Cfree speech, war on Ukraine and war on our children\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Five of RFK Jr\u8217\'20\'19s siblings have shared a statement denouncing their brother\u8217\'20\'19s decision to endorse Trump. \u8220\'20\'1CWe want an America filled with hope and bound together by a shared vision of a brighter future, a future defined by individual freedom, economic promise and national pride. We believe in Harris and Walz. Our brother Bobby\u8217\'20\'19s decision to endorse Trump today is a betrayal of the values that our father and our family hold most dear. It is a sad ending to a sad story,\u8221\'20\'1D they said.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 JD Vance will attend a fundraiser next month hosted by Keith Rabois, Jacob Helberg and the \u8220\'20\'1CTrump 47 Jewish Coalition\u8221\'20\'1D. Rabois, an investor, and Helberg, an author and technology investor, are both Jewish (the two are also married). They have been critical of the \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  administration\u8217\'20\'19s handling of the war in Gaza, saying the president has not been vocally supportive enough of Israel.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 In separate appearances on Fox News on Thursday, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  and Georgia governor Brian Kemp set their long-held distaste for each other aside, with Kemp endorsing Trump and Trump calling Kemp \u8220\'20\'1Cvery nice\u8221\'20\'1D. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ve got to win from the top of the ticket on down,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxnews.com/video/6360852511112"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kemp said}}}\uc2 , speaking in response to \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s nomination at the Democratic national convention last night. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need to send \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  back to the White House.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Merrick Garland\uc2  announced this morning that the justice department has filed an anti-trust lawsuit against the real estate software company \uc2 RealPage\uc2 . The DoJ alleges that \uc2 RealPage\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s algorithm provided landlords with recommended prices for rentals that allowed them to align their rents.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Several Secret Service personnel from the Pittsburgh field office have been reassigned to administrative duties and ordered to work from home following last month\u8217\'20\'19s assassination attempt on \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/08/23/politics/secret-service-employees-trump-shooting/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to}}}\uc2  sources speaking to CNN. In a report on Friday, CNN also reported that a member of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s security detail has also been reassigned to administrative duties.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 In response to \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s speech at the Democratic national convention on Thursday, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s campaign released an email on Friday morning, calling Harris \u8220\'20\'1Cdangerously liberal, not a centrist\u8221\'20\'1D. It went on to say: \u8220\'20\'1CHer record includes being named the most liberal senator, supporting eliminating private health insurance, and saying we need to \u8216\'20\'18redirect resources\u8217\'20\'19 from police. \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  is dangerously liberal, describing her as anything else is a lie.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 , chair of the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 , said on Friday that \u8220\'20\'1Cthe time has come\u8221\'20\'1D to cut rates, Reuters reports. During a speech at the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s annual economic conference in Wyoming, Powell said: \u8220\'20\'1CThe time has come for policy to adjust. The direction of travel is clear, and the timing and pace of rate cuts will depend on incoming data, the evolving outlook and the balance of risks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 9.31pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.55pm BST\par \par \uc2 Robert Kennedy Jr.\uc2  announced Friday that he is dropping out of the US presidential race and throwing his support behind \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The 70-year-old scion of the expansive and reliably Democrat family said in a Pennsylvania court filing that he was dropping out of the 2024 race for the White House, according to the Associated Press.\par \par \uc2 Kennedy, a life-long Democrat before he switched to independent \u8211\'20\'13 a reflection of his frustration after he was essentially blocked from challenging \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  for the party nomination and later lost Democrat-financed challenges to appearing on state ballots -, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Acyn/status/1827056625783279865"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said during a press conference }}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1Cin an honest system, I believe I would have won the election\u8230\'20\'26\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Kennedy point to the system that his father, attorney general \uc2 Robert F. Kennedy\uc2 , and uncle, president \uc2 John F. Kennedy\uc2 , he said, had thrived in \u8211\'20\'13 \u8216\'20\'18a system with open debates, primaries with regularly scheduled debates, a truly independent media untainted by government propaganda and censorship, a system of non-partisan courts and election boards, everything would be different.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He said polls had shown him beating existing candidates in terms of favorability. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m sorry to say that while democracy may still be alive at the grassroots, it has become little more than a slogan for our political institutions, for our media, for our government and most sadly of all for me and the Democratic party.\par \par \uc2 Kennedy\u8217\'20\'19s running mate, Nicole Shanahan, had hinted the Kennedy campaign might join forces with Trump or forming a new party \u8220\'20\'1Cbecause we draw votes from Trump\u8221\'20\'1D or \u8220\'20\'1Cwe walk away right now and join forces with \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 . We walk away from that and we explain to our base why we\u8217\'20\'19re making this decision.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 At the height of his campaign. Kennedy was polling at 10% of voters but since Biden dropped out from re-election in July and vice president \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  stepped in, Kennedy\u8217\'20\'19s polling support halved. The big question is where that remaining 5% of voters go \u8211\'20\'13 with Kennedy and Trump, to Democrats, or withhold their vote entirely.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.47pm BST\par \par \uc2 At a campaign stop at a restaurant in Las Vegas, Nevada, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  opened his remarks with a focus on tipped income, and his proposal to abolish taxes on tipped income if elected.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNobody ever heard of this concept before,\u8221\'20\'1D said Trump, of his proposal to do away with taxes on tips, a form of taxation that especially affects restaurant workers. He called \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , who has said she supports the same kind of policy, a \u8220\'20\'1Ccopycat\u8221\'20\'1D and complained about her decision to back the policy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCan we get the culinary union to vote for Trump?\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CA lot of them are voting for us, I can tell you that.\u8221\'20\'1D The Culinary Union, which represents workers in food service, hotels and gaming, has already endorsed Harris for president.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe path to victory runs through Nevada, and the Culinary Union will deliver Nevada for president \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  and vice president \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D wrote Ted Pappageorge, secretary-treasurer of the Culinary Workers Union in Las Vegas, in a 9 August statement.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 9.03pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.41pm BST\par \par \uc2 Trump acknowledges 'very nice endorsement' from RFK Jr\par \par \uc2 Speaking in Las Vegas today, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  acknowledged a \u8220\'20\'1Cvery nice endorsement from RFK Jr \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat\u8217\'20\'19s big,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s a great guy, respected by everybody.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 enltrPRESIDENT TRUMP: "We just had a very nice endorsement from RFK JR!" {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/yNmooMWGo4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/yNmooMWGo4}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Trump War Room (@TrumpWarRoom) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TrumpWarRoom/status/1827065223712522674?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Trump added that he will discuss the endorsement further at a rally in Arizona this afternoon. RFK Jr was still concluding his remarks at the time.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.54pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.22pm BST\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr's siblings issue statement condemning his endorsement of Trump\par \par \uc2 Five of RFK Jr\u8217\'20\'19s siblings have shared a statement denouncing their brother\u8217\'20\'19s decision to endorse Trump.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe want an America filled with hope and bound together by a shared vision of a brighter future, a future defined by individual freedom, economic promise and national pride. We believe in Harris and Walz. Our brother Bobby\u8217\'20\'19s decision to endorse Trump today is a betrayal of the values that our father and our family hold most dear. It is a sad ending to a sad story,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Kathleen Kennedy Townsend\uc2 , Courtney Kennedy, Kerry Kennedy, \uc2 Chris Kennedy\uc2  and Rory Kennedy said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 enltrI am sharing a personal statement that my family and I have made in response to my brother\u8217\'20\'19s announcement. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/j7vTTabNYZ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/j7vTTabNYZ}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Kerry Kennedy (@KerryKennedyRFK) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KerryKennedyRFK/status/1827061350452887816?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.24pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.15pm BST\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr\u8217\'20\'19s campaign has clarified that it did not intend to endorse \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  in a Pennsylvania court filing, according to reports.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMr Kennedy has not endorsed president Trump,\u8221\'20\'1D Stefanie Spear, a campaign spokesperson, said in a statement {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/elections/2024/08/23/harris-trump-rfk-jr-election-updates/#link-G7HAIZWHRRB7VEENJYBNMUEJHM"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to the Washington Post}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThe filing was made by an attorney and not reviewed by the campaign. The filing is being updated.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The news comes as RFK Jr is speaking live to the nation.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.29pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.07pm BST\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr will 'now throw my support to president Trump'\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr said he will \u8220\'20\'1Cnow throw my support to president Trump \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Citing the reasons for his endorsement of \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , he said the causes \u8220\'20\'1Cwere free speech, war in Ukraine and the war on our children\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.30pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.04pm BST\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr on his campaign: 'I am simply suspending it and not ending it'\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI want everyone to know that I am not terminating my campaign. I am simply suspending it and not ending it,\u8221\'20\'1D RFK Jr said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy name will remain on the ballot in most states. If you live in a blue state, you can vote for me without harming or helping president Trump or Vice-President Harris,\u8221\'20\'1D he added, saying: \u8220\'20\'1CIn about 10 battleground states where my presence would be a spoiler, I\u8217\'20\'19m going to remove my name, and I\u8217\'20\'19ve already started that process and urge voters not to vote for me.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.30pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.56pm BST\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere in Chicago, a string of Democratic speakers mentioned \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  147 times just on the first day,\u8221\'20\'1D RFK Jr said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWho needs a policy when you have Trump to hate. In contrast, at the \uc2 RNC\uc2  convention, president Biden was mentioned only twice in four days \u8230\'20\'26 What most alarms me is how the Democratic party conducts its internal affairs, or runs its candidates, let alone \u8230\'20\'26 resort to censorship and media control, and weaponization of the federal agencies,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.31pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.52pm BST\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNow, in an honest system, I believe that I would have won the election,\u8221\'20\'1D RFK Jr said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy father and my uncle thrived in a system \u8230\'20\'26 [of] open debates with fair primaries, with a regularly scheduled debate with fair primaries and with a truly independent media, untainted by government propaganda and censorship. In a system of nonpartisan courts and election boards, everything would be different.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.31pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.50pm BST\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI want to thank all of those dedicated volunteers and congratulate the campaign staff who coordinated this enormous logistical feat,\u8221\'20\'1D RFK Jr said, referring to his presidential run.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYour accomplishments were regarded as impossible. You carried me up that glass mountain. You pulled off a miracle. You achieved what all the pundits said could never be done. You have my deepest gratitude, and I\u8217\'20\'19m never going to forget that, not just for what you did, for my campaign, but for the sacrifices you made because you love our country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.35pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.48pm BST\par \par \uc2 RFK on Democratic party: 'It had become the party of war, censorship, corruption'\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs you know, I left that party in October because it had departed so dramatically on the core values that I grew up with,\u8221\'20\'1D RFK Jr said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt had become the party of war, censorship, corruption, big pharma, big tech \u8230\'20\'26 and big money. When it abandoned democracy by cancelling the primary to conceal the cognitive decline of the sitting president, I left the party to run as an independent.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.35pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.47pm BST\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI began this journey as a Democrat, the party of my father, my uncle, the party which I pledged my own allegiance to all before I was old enough to vote,\u8221\'20\'1D RFK Jr said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI attended my first Democratic convention at the age of six in 1960 and back then, the Democrats were the champions of the constitution of civil rights. The Democrats stood against authoritarianism, against censorship, against colonialism, imperialism and unjust wars. We were the party of labor.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.36pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.45pm BST\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr is now live on stage.\par \par \uc2 Stay tuned as we bring you the latest updates.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.24pm BST\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr's campaign endorses Trump in Pennsylvania court filing on Friday - report\par \par \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s campaign endorsed \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  in a Pennsylvania court filing on Friday, the Associated Press reports.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, the independent candidate\u8217\'20\'19s campaign requested that he be removed from the Pennsylvania ballot, according to the Associated Press. The move comes a day after he filed paperwork to withdraw from presidential ballots in Arizona.\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr is due to deliver an address on his widely speculated withdrawal from the presidential race in a few minutes. According to his campaign, the speech will be \u8220\'20\'1Cabout the present historical moment and his path forward\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.36pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.17pm BST\par \par \uc2 JD Vance will attend a fundraiser next month hosted by Keith Rabois, Jacob Helberg and the \u8220\'20\'1CTrump 47 Jewish Coalition\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Rabois, an investor, and Helberg, an author and technology investor, are both Jewish (the two are also married). They have been critical of the \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  administration\u8217\'20\'19s handling of the war in Gaza, saying the president has not been vocally supportive enough of Israel.\par \par \uc2 In May, Helberg wrote: \u8220\'20\'1CIf you support Israel, there\u8217\'20\'19s only one choice in this election.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 enltrOn American Jewish Heritage Month, American Jews who still support Biden should have their heads examined.\par \par \uc2 If you support Israel, there\u8217\'20\'19s only one choice in this election. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/uL40QFte1U"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/uL40QFte1U}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Jacob Helberg (@jacobhelberg) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/jacobhelberg/status/1788586869569048895?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 9, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Tickets for the 12 September dinner in Manhattan will be $100,000 or $250,000.\par \par \uc2 enltrNEW \u8212\'20\'14\par \par \uc2 JD Vance to raise money next month in New York City, hosted by Keith {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rabois?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @rabois}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/jacobhelberg?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @jacobhelberg}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Jewish-focused fundraising dinner.\par \par \uc2 Tickets for either $100k or $250k. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/GzQA5yCwyj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/GzQA5yCwyj}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Teddy Schleifer (@teddyschleifer) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/teddyschleifer/status/1826975874656207326?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 7.44pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.51pm BST\par \par \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2  to hold press conference where he is widely expected to end campaign\par \par \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2  is set to hold a press conference at 2 .30pm ET, where he is expected to announce his widely speculated withdrawal from the presidential race.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 Adrian Fontes\uc2 , the Arizona secretary of state, the independent candidate has filed paperwork to withdraw from presidential ballots in the state.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 7.28pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.48pm BST\par \par \uc2 In a segment on the Daily Show, host Jon Stewart pointed out the absence of a Palestinian American speaker at the Democratic national convention, despite the representations of Americans from other varying communities over the course of four days, including the parents of an American Israeli hostage kidnapped by \uc2 Hamas\uc2  last October.\par \par \uc2 Speaking sarcastically and pointing out the apparent hypocrisy between the convention\u8217\'20\'19s theme of joy and Israel\u8217\'20\'19s killing of more than 40,000 Palestinians since last October, Stewart said:\par \par \uc2 They have Black Americans, Hispanic Americans, Asian Americans, gay Americans, Jewish Americans, Palestinian Am\u8211\'20\'13, oh. Well, to be fair, it was only four nights, eight hours a night. Really, it\u8217\'20\'19s best not to think about the consequences of our actions over there, especially given the theme of the week.\par \par \uc2 Stewart went on to show a montage of various Democrats talking about feeling \u8220\'20\'1Cjoy\u8221\'20\'1D at the convention.\par \par \uc2 In response to Stewart\u8217\'20\'19s segment, the uncommitted movement wrote on X: \u8220\'20\'1CThank you, @JonStewart.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 enltrThank you, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/jonstewart?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @jonstewart}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/9dZ3obPj0C"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/9dZ3obPj0C}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Uncommitted National Movement ?? (@uncommittedmvmt) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/uncommittedmvmt/status/1826984199384940616?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 This past week, the convention failed to meet uncommitted delegates\u8217\'20\'19 request for a Palestinian speaker while thousands of anti-war protesters took to the Chicago streets over their disapproval of US policies on Israel\u8217\'20\'19s deadly war in Gaza.\par \par \uc2 Videos on social media also appeared to show various convention attendees covering their ears as they walked past anti-war protestors chanting the names of Palestinians, including children, killed by Israeli forces across Gaza.\par \par \uc2 enltr??Chicago Illinois | DNC attendees covered their ears the same way they cover their eyes when it comes to the genocide in Gaza. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Z8MXoMWimN"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/Z8MXoMWimN}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 WearThePeace (@WearThePeaceCo) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WearThePeaceCo/status/1826483616051875913?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 22, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 7.30pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.09pm BST\par \par \uc2 At a press conference today, Chicago mayor Brandon Johnson called the city\u8217\'20\'19s performance hosting the Democratic national convention a success for policing. He said:\par \par \uc2 If the 1968 convention went down in history as the example of police brutality, then the 2024 convention will go down as the example of constitutional policing.\par \par \uc2 Thousands of demonstrators gathered outside the convention this week to protest the Democratic party\u8217\'20\'19s support for Israel in the Gaza war.\par \par \uc2 According to the \uc2 National Lawyers Guild\uc2 , which deployed legal observers to monitor policing during the protests, close to 90 protesters were arrested over the course of the week, 14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nlgchicago.org/2024/08/20/democratic-national-convention-begins-with-massive-shows-of-police-force-aggressive-responses-to-protesters/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earlier in the week}}}\uc2  and 72, including two journalists, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nlgchicago.org/2024/08/21/chicago-police-arrest-dozens-during-palestine-solidarity-protest-at-israeli-consulate-on-second-day-of-democratic-national-convention/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 during a demonstration}}}\uc2  outside the Israeli consulate on Tuesday. At least four protesters were hospitalized following their arrests, the Intercept {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://theintercept.com/2024/08/20/dnc-protesters-hospitalized-police-violence-chicago/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe repressive police response to a Palestine solidarity protest at the Israeli consulate seemed pre-planned and designed to stifle free expression during the Democratic national convention,\u8221\'20\'1D said Ben Meyer of the Guild\u8217\'20\'19s Chicago chapter.\par \par \uc2 Assurances that the city would respect people\u8217\'20\'19s first amendment rights during the convention rings hollow next to this brazenly aggressive approach to free expression.\par \par \uc2 Chicago notably hosted the Democratic national convention in 1968, when protesters demonstrating against the Vietnam war also gathered outside the convention and were teargassed, beaten and arrested en masse.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/19/pro-palestinian-protest-democratic-convention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pro-Palestinian protesters march before Democratic convention: \u8216\'20\'18This is about morality\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/17/dnc-democratic-convention-chicago-1968"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18The world is watching\u8217\'20\'19: 1968 protests set stage for Democratic convention}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 7.35pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.04pm BST\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  asked \uc2 Benjamin Netanyahu\uc2  during a call on Wednesday to pull Israeli troops back from part of the Egypt-Gaza border as part of an initial phase of a ceasefire deal so that talks could continue, according to a report.\par \par \uc2 The US president asked Israel\u8217\'20\'19s prime minister to agree to withdraw the \uc2 Israel Defense Forces\uc2  (\uc2 IDF\uc2 ) from a small part of the Philadelphi corridor during the implementation of the first phase of the deal, Axios is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.axios.com/2024/08/23/biden-netanyahu-israeli-forces-withdraw-gaza-egypt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reporting}}}\uc2 , citing Israeli officials.\par \par \uc2 Netanyahu partially accepted Biden\u8217\'20\'19s request and agreed to give up one Israeli position along the border, they told the outlet.\par \par \uc2 It comes as John Kirby, the White House\u8217\'20\'19s national security spokesperson, described the latest Gaza talks as having been \u8220\'20\'1Cconstructive\u8221\'20\'1D. Kirby told reporters on Friday:\par \par \uc2 We\u8217\'20\'19re in Cairo. They\u8217\'20\'19re in Cairo. We need \uc2 Hamas\uc2  to participate, and we need to get down to the brass tacks of locking in these details. And that\u8217\'20\'19s what we\u8217\'20\'19re focused on here in the next, coming days here over the course of the weekend.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.28pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.52pm BST\par \par \uc2 Elizabeth Warren, the Democratic senator for Massachusetts, reflected on the roaring standing ovation she received from the crowd before her speech at the convention on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Warren was visibly emotional before her speech, during which she gave an emphatic endorsement of \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , whom she painted as a strong figure who \u8220\'20\'1Cgets it\u8221\'20\'1D and will defend the rights and economic interests of Americans.\par \par \uc2 enltrElizabeth Warren on Morning Joe this morning was still emotional about the huge ovation she got yesterday at the DNC. It was one of my favorite moments from the convention and there are so many to choose from. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/AEcjT75SXR"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/AEcjT75SXR}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Aaron Rupar (@atrupar) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/atrupar/status/1827011933892997332?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.28pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.37pm BST\par \par \uc2 James Comey\uc2 , the former \uc2 FBI\uc2  director, has posted to X to say that \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cmade me feel like it\u8217\'20\'19s finally morning in America\u8221\'20\'1D, adding:\par \par \uc2 Everyone who cares about the rule of law and America\u8217\'20\'19s indispensable role in the world should vote for Harris and [Tim] Walz. I will.\par \par \uc2 enltrKamala Harris made me feel like it\u8217\'20\'19s finally morning in America. Everyone who cares about the rule of law and America\u8217\'20\'19s indispensable role in the world should vote for Harris and Walz. I will.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 James Comey\uc2  (@Comey) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Comey/status/1826980127449976874?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Comey, who led the \uc2 FBI\uc2  during the Obama administration before being fired by \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  just months into his presidency, endorsed \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  during the 2020 Democratic primary.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.29pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.29pm BST\par \par \uc2 In separate appearances on Fox News on Thursday, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and Georgia governor Brian Kemp set their long-held distaste for each other aside, with Kemp endorsing Trump and Trump calling Kemp \u8220\'20\'1Cvery nice \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ve got to win from the top of the ticket on down,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxnews.com/video/6360852511112"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kemp said}}}\uc2 , speaking in response to \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s nomination at the Democratic national convention last night. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need to send \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  back to the White House.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Responding to Kemp\u8217\'20\'19s endorsement later that evening, Trump told the network: \u8220\'20\'1CI think we\u8217\'20\'19re going to have a very good relationship with Brian Kemp.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Later, the former president {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/posts/113008796172112928"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  on Truth Social:\par \par \uc2 Thank you to #BrianKempGA for all of your help and support in Georgia, where a win is so important to the success of our Party and, most importantly, our Country. I look forward to working with you, your team, and all of my friends in Georgia to help MAKE AMERICA GREAT AGAIN!\par \par \uc2 Trump and Kemp have feuded since 2020, when Kemp refused to help Trump overturn the 2020 election results. The former president lost the state of Georgia by a narrow margin of about 12,000 votes.\par \par \uc2 This year alone, the two have continued at each other\u8217\'20\'19s throats, with Kemp saying he cast a blank ballot rather than vote for Trump in the Republican primary election and Trump calling Kemp a \u8220\'20\'1Cbad guy\u8221\'20\'1D at a rally just three weeks ago.\par \par \uc2 For more on the legacy of Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s continued election deniers, read Sam Levine\u8217\'20\'19s latest:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/georgia-election-deniers-pass-new-laws-election-chaos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Georgia election deniers helped pass new voting rules. Many worry it\u8217\'20\'19ll lead to chaos in November}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/19/georgia-election-rule-delay"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Georgia approves election rule that could delay vote certification}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.31pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.20pm BST\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  said it was \u8220\'20\'1Cpossible\u8221\'20\'1D he would meet with \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2  amid reports that the independent presidential candidate plans to drop out of the race and endorse Trump.\par \par \uc2 Kennedy is scheduled to deliver a public address this afternoon in Phoenix, Arizona. Meanwhile, Trump is scheduled to speak at an event in Glendale, Arizona, where he will be joined by a \u8220\'20\'1Cspecial guest\u8221\'20\'1D, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.donaldjtrump.com/news/1d65a65c-407f-4f3f-9c1a-0b27d835d104"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to his campaign.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI have no idea if he\u8217\'20\'19s going to endorse me,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump told Fox News late last night.\par \par \uc2 I know he\u8217\'20\'19s got a news conference, we happen to be in the same state, Arizona, we\u8217\'20\'19ll be in the same state, but in quite different parts of the state. But it\u8217\'20\'19s possible we will be meeting tomorrow and we\u8217\'20\'19ll be discussing it.\par \par \uc2 As we {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/aug/23/dnc-kamala-harris-trump-rfk-campaign-election-updates?page=with:block-66c892258f089e7649975435#block-66c892258f089e7649975435"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported earlier}}}\uc2 , Kennedy is reported to be facing pushback from wife, Cheryl Hines, over rumored plans to throw his support behind Trump.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.30pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.02pm BST\par \par \uc2 Merrick Garland\uc2  announced this morning that the justice department has filed an anti-trust lawsuit against the real estate software company \uc2 RealPage\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The DoJ alleges that \uc2 RealPage\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s algorithm provided landlords with recommended prices for rentals that allowed them to align their rents.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen the Sherman Act was passed, an anti-competitive scheme might have looked like robber barons shaking hands at a secret meeting. Today, it looks like landlords using mathematical algorithms to align their rents. But anti-trust law does not become obsolete simply because competitors find new ways to unlawfully act in concert,\u8221\'20\'1D the US attorney general said.\par \par \uc2 enltrAG \uc2 Merrick Garland\uc2  announces that the DOJ has filed an antitrust lawsuit against the real estate software company \uc2 RealPage\uc2  for enabling "landlords to sidestep vigorous competition in the rental market" and raise rents. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/KmeywaGVzo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/KmeywaGVzo}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 The Recount (@therecount) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/therecount/status/1827002723700453781?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 In a statement posted on its website in June, after attorneys general in several states sued the company, \uc2 RealPage\uc2  called the allegations \u8220\'20\'1Cfalse and misleading\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit comes in the wake of several other anti-trust efforts from the Biden administration just this year, including suits against Live Nation and \uc2 Apple\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 For more on those efforts, see:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/article/2024/may/23/live-nation-ticketmaster-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US sues Ticketmaster owner Live Nation and seeks break-up of alleged monopoly }}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2024/mar/21/us-antitrust-lawsuit-apple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US accuses Apple of \u8216\'20\'18broad, sustained, and illegal\u8217\'20\'19 smartphone monopoly}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.33pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 4.32pm BST\par \par \uc2 Several Secret Service personnel from the Pittsburgh field office have been reassigned to administrative duties and ordered to work from home following last month\u8217\'20\'19s assassination attempt on \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/08/23/politics/secret-service-employees-trump-shooting/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to}}}\uc2  sources speaking to CNN.\par \par \uc2 In a report on Friday, CNN also reported that a member of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s security detail has also been reassigned to administrative duties.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, Ronald Rowe, the acting Secret Service director, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/02/security-service-failure-trump-shooting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that the Secret Service takes \u8220\'20\'1Cfull responsibility\u8221\'20\'1D for the security failures in the assassination attempt, in addition to admitting to errors in communication and surveillance.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.34pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 4.06pm BST\par \par \uc2 The Trump campaign on Harris following convention speech: 'Dangerously liberal, not a centrist'\par \par \uc2 In response to \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s speech at the Democratic national convention on Thursday, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s campaign released an email on Friday morning, calling Harris \u8220\'20\'1Cdangerously liberal, not a centrist \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In the email, Trump\u8217\'20\'19s campaign wrote: \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  has apparently expanded her press department to include the \uc2 New York Times\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D citing a \uc2 New York Times\uc2  article that described Harris\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cmove to the political center\u8221\'20\'1D which \u8220\'20\'1Cseems to be working\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Citing the article, Trump\u8217\'20\'19s campaign said, \u8220\'20\'1CThat\u8217\'20\'19s nonsensical,\u8221\'20\'1D adding: \u8220\'20\'1CKamala is no centrist.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It went on to say:\par \par \uc2 Her record includes being named the most liberal senator, supporting eliminating private health insurance, and saying we need to \u8216\'20\'18redirect resources\u8217\'20\'19 from police. \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  is dangerously liberal, describing her as anything else is a lie.\par \par \uc2 The latest email from Trump\u8217\'20\'19s campaign follows a series of angry posts Trump fired off Thursday evening on Truth Social during Harris\u8217\'20\'19s speech. In addition to accusing Harris of being \u8220\'20\'1Cweak and ineffective\u8221\'20\'1D and having \u8220\'20\'1Cdone nothing for three and a half years but talk\u8221\'20\'1D, Trump accused her of standing for \u8220\'20\'1Cincompetence and weakness\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 With only a few weeks left until election day, the two are neck and neck in the polls, particularly in crucial battleground states.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.36pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 3.37pm BST\par \par \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 , chair of the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 , said on Friday that \u8220\'20\'1Cthe time has come\u8221\'20\'1D to cut rates, Reuters reports.\par \par \uc2 During a speech at the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s annual economic conference in Wyoming, Powell said:\par \par \uc2 The time has come for policy to adjust. The direction of travel is clear, and the timing and pace of rate cuts will depend on incoming data, the evolving outlook and the balance of risks.\par \par \uc2 Powell went on to add that his \u8220\'20\'1Cconfidence has grown that inflation is on a sustainable path back to 2%\u8221\'20\'1D after it rose to 7% during the pandemic.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.37pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 3.09pm BST\par \par \uc2 With Democrats celebrating as a \u8220\'20\'1Cjoyful\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  puts them back in the game, the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s Ed Pilkington reports on their reactions from the Democratic national convention and the long road they face before November:\par \par \uc2 Five weeks ago, Democrats were preparing to hold their national convention in Chicago under a pall, weighed down by fears of defeat and what \uc2 Michelle Obama\uc2  called a \u8220\'20\'1Cpalpable sense of dread about the future\u8221\'20\'1D. An 81-year-old president, trailing badly in the polls, would face his people as they cowered before the prospect of four more years of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  and his bloodlust for retribution.\par \par \uc2 What we got at the DNC in Chicago was a week-long celebration that went well beyond the relief that the party evidently feels now that it is back in the game. There was rejoicing in the energy and confidence that has been unleashed by the unexpected metamorphosis from \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  to the \u8220\'20\'1Cjoyful warrior\u8221\'20\'1D, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Relief and rejoicing were written on Harris\u8217\'20\'19s face as she took the stage in Biden\u8217\'20\'19s place on Thursday night. She was met by a roar from delegates, many dressed in blazing white in homage to the suffragette movement without which they would not have been marking the nomination of the first Black and Asian American woman on a major party ticket.\par \par \uc2 For the full story, click here:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/kamala-harris-democrats-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democrats rejoice as \u8216\'20\'18joyful\u8217\'20\'19 Kamala Harris puts them back in the game}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.39pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 2.44pm BST\par \par \uc2 RFK Jr reportedly facing pushback from wife, Cheryl Hines, over rumored exit\par \par \uc2 Robert F Kennedy is reported to be facing pushback from wife and Curb Your Enthusiasm star Cheryl Hines over the independent presidential candidate\u8217\'20\'19s rumored plans to throw his support behind \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  later today.\par \par \uc2 The Kennedy campaign filed paperwork late Thursday to withdraw from the ballot in Arizona as speculation swirls that his presidential ambitions are coming to a close amid falling polls numbers and a campaign cash crunch.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/4842563-kennedy-trump-endorsement-election-chaos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 But, according to the Hill,}}}\uc2  Kennedy\u8217\'20\'19s negotiations with the Trump campaign to forge an alliance, which could in theory add Kennedy\u8217\'20\'19s 5% national support to Trump\u8217\'20\'19s side of the polling ledger, is not popular with Hines.\par \par \uc2 A source told the publication that Hines \u8220\'20\'1Creally does not want him\u8221\'20\'1D to back Trump.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s contending with that,\u8221\'20\'1D the source said.\par \par \uc2 The Kennedy and Trump campaigns are reported to have been in discussions for several weeks. \u8220\'20\'1CIt would be so good for [me] and so good for you,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said in a recorded phone call to the former Democrat last month.\par \par \uc2 But it\u8217\'20\'19s not clear that Kennedy supporters would necessarily follow the independent candidate to the Trump ticket. Kennedy\u8217\'20\'19s polling has roughly halved since \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  dropped out and \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  took up the mantle of presidential hopeful.\par \par \uc2 That suggests in part that Kennedy\u8217\'20\'19s appeal to supporters rests on his being a non-major-party candidate.\par \par \uc2 According to the Hill, Kennedy and Hines agree to disagree on some of the candidate\u8217\'20\'19s conspiracy-minded positions, including those around vaccines skepticism, which Trump sometimes appears to share.\par \par \uc2 When Kennedy compared vaccine mandates to the Nazi Holocaust \u8211\'20\'13 a comment he later walked back \u8211\'20\'13 Hines {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/HCTrudo/status/1826379237181587750"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted on X}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CMy husband\u8217\'20\'19s opinions are not a reflection of my own. While we love each other, we differ on many current issues.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.44pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 2.28pm BST\par \par \uc2 Here is the response from another undecided Pennsylvania voter on CNN on why he decided to vote for \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  following her speech last night at the DNC:\par \par \uc2 I was looking for policy information \u8230\'20\'26 I like what she gave on military, what she wants to do for our veterans. And with border control. I just think that she has a lot of good ideas and she is very well-spoken. I think she was very professional.\par \par \uc2 enltrUndecided Voter: I like what she gave on military, what she wants to do for our veterans. And with border control. I just think that she has a lot of good ideas and she is very well spoken. I think she was very professional. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/fxhIHqoMmA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/fxhIHqoMmA}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Acyn (@Acyn) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Acyn/status/1826845716888912185?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Addressing the convention last night, Harris said:\par \par \uc2 I will fulfill our sacred obligation to care for our troops and their families, and I will always honor and never disparage their service and their sacrifice.\par \par \uc2 On border control, Harris vowed:\par \par \uc2 As president, I will bring back the bipartisan border security bill that he killed, and I will sign it into law. I know \u8211\'20\'13 I know we can live up to our proud heritage as a nation of immigrants and reform our broken immigration system. We can create an earned pathway to citizenship and secure our border.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.45pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 2.07pm BST\par \par \uc2 Following \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s speech yesterday evening, a handful of undecided Pennsylvania voters raised their hands on CNN in response to whether they were ready to make a commitment to any candidate in November.\par \par \uc2 Among eight undecided voters, all but one raised their hands to the question. Six voters indicated that they would vote for Harris, one said Trump and another remained undecided.\par \par \uc2 In response to what led them to make up their minds on Harris, one person said:\par \par \uc2 I really liked her confidence. She really seemed presidential \u8230\'20\'26 She spoke from her heart.\par \par \uc2 enltrReporter: None of you were ready to make a commitment to any candidate in November. Please raise your hand if you\u8217\'20\'19re ready to make a commitment after today. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/yC4SgZOrsq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/yC4SgZOrsq}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Acyn (@Acyn) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Acyn/status/1826847648424579515?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.46pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 1.53pm BST\par \par \uc2 For approximately 45 minutes on Thursday evening, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  tried to show the US who she is and why she is worthy of being its next president.\par \par \uc2 Here are several key takeaways from her speech and the Democratic national convention\u8217\'20\'19s final night by the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s Sam Levine:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  accepted the nomination \u8220\'20\'1Cguided by optimism and faith\u8221\'20\'1D: The vice-president\u8217\'20\'19s speech offered a forceful rebuke of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  and laid out the stakes of the election.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Harris said she would \u8220\'20\'1Calways stand for Israel\u8221\'20\'1D and called for \u8220\'20\'1CPalestinian self-determination\u8221\'20\'1D: After days of sustained pro-Palestinian protests calling for an arms embargo on Israel, Harris\u8217\'20\'19s address offered both a defense of Israel and a call for Palestinian self-determination.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The convention denied requests for a Palestinian speaker, sparking outrage: The convention ended without a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/22/uncommitted-movement-deadline-delegates-democratic-convention-protest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Palestinian American speaker}}}\uc2  on the main stage, a key demand of the uncommitted movement. The Harris campaign and Democratic party faced increasing pressure throughout the week to include a Palestinian voice, particularly after parents of a \uc2 Hamas\uc2  hostage were given a speaking slot and delivered emotional testimony on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 For more key takeaways, click here:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/kamala-harris-democratic-convention-key-takeaways"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris\u8217\'20\'19s big moment, and a message of hope: key takeaways from the Democratic convention\u8217\'20\'19s final night}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.48pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 1.50pm BST\par \par \uc2 Democrats in for hard-fought election after joyful convention as RFK Jr set to announce end of campaign\par \par \uc2 Good morning,\par \par \uc2 Following an energetic few days at the Democratic national convention in Chicago, where last night \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  deliver the biggest speech of her career, Democrats are now in for the hard part.\par \par \uc2 With many in the party celebrating as a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/kamala-harris-democrats-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 joyful}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D Harris offered the much-needed hope following \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s lackluster campaign performances several weeks ago, Democrats will now fight tooth and nail in battleground states where Harris is polling by just a knife\u8217\'20\'19s edge over \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Additionally, with the convention\u8217\'20\'19s failure to meet uncommitted delegates\u8217\'20\'19 request for a Palestinian speaker and thousands of anti-war protesters taking to the Chicago streets over their disapproval of US policies on Israel\u8217\'20\'19s deadly war in Gaza, Harris and Democrats will need to figure out how to win the support of those voters come November. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/22/uncommitted-movement-deadline-delegates-democratic-convention-protest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 For many}}}\uc2 , the answer is simple: adhere to demands for a ceasefire and an arms embargo on Israel.\par \par \uc2 Trump remains on the offence. Over the course of Harris\u8217\'20\'19s speech, Trump fired off dozens of posts on Truth Social, accusing her of \u8220\'20\'1Ccomplaining about everything but doing nothing\u8221\'20\'1D and calling her \u8220\'20\'1Cweak and ineffective\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2  is scheduled to deliver a public address this afternoon in Arizona amid reports of the independent presidential candidate\u8217\'20\'19s widely speculated withdrawal.\par \par \uc2 Here are other developments in US politics:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Trump is set to deliver remarks on his no-tax-on-tips proposal in Las Vegas today before heading to a rally in Arizona.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 New details have emerged about communication failures prior to Trump\u8217\'20\'19s assassination attempt last month, including forgotten radios, CNN {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/08/23/politics/trump-rally-shooting-communication-failures/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.51pm BST\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240823ek8n001mn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
