\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 New York Planned Parenthood staff decry \u8216\'20\'18devastating\u8217\'20\'19  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  service cuts\b0\par\par\uc2 Susan Rinkunas \par \uc2 843 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 August 2024\par 11:03 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Health non-profit\u8217\'20\'19s affiliate announced changes for September, but staff say \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access is already limited\par \par \uc2 In the coming weeks, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/planned-parenthood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Planned Parenthood}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s Manhattan health center will stop offering core reproductive health services, including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 abortions}}}\uc2  after 20 weeks and deep sedation for procedures like \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  or IUD insertion.\par \par \uc2 The Manhattan clinic currently offers \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  through 24 weeks and is the only \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  location in the state that does so. The group has been beset by financial challenges, and plans to close a number of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/new-york"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New York}}}\uc2  clinics in the near future.\par \par \uc2 Planned Parenthood of Greater New York (PPGNY), which operates the Manhattan clinic, announced the changes \u8211\'20\'13 which the group said were temporary and would take effect on 3 September \u8211\'20\'13 earlier this month, blaming them on financial problems. The organization said it would refer patients in need of those services to independent providers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAny reduction of access is really devastating,\u8221\'20\'1D one staff member said. \u8220\'20\'1CPeople who are seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  later in their pregnancy are a really vulnerable and highly stigmatized group of people.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Staffers said that the clinic already quietly stopped providing some services, more than three weeks before the 3 September date.\par \par \uc2 In a release, PPGNY {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.plannedparenthood.org/planned-parenthood-greater-new-york/about/news/citing-financial-challenges-planned-parenthood-of-greater-new-york-moves-to-temporarily-pause-deep-sedation-services-in-manhattan-and-close-four-health-centers-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cited}}}\uc2  budget shortfalls due in part to state lawmakers failing to increase Medicaid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nynmedia.com/opinion/2024/07/opinion-states-abortion-access-ecosystem-pushed-limit-two-years-after-demise-roe-v-wade/397800/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reimbursement rates}}}\uc2  for medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . More than {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nynmedia.com/opinion/2024/07/opinion-states-abortion-access-ecosystem-pushed-limit-two-years-after-demise-roe-v-wade/397800/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 half}}}\uc2  of the organization\u8217\'20\'19s patients have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/medicaid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Medicaid}}}\uc2 , a state-run health insurance program for low-income people. The affiliate says the financial strain makes it unable to afford a third-party anaesthesia provider, and that deep sedation is its standard of care for abortions after 20 weeks.\par \par \uc2 The New York affiliate said it has instituted other cost-cutting measures such as executive pay cuts and consolidated job functions, but PPGNY also plans to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.plannedparenthood.org/planned-parenthood-greater-new-york/about/news/citing-financial-challenges-planned-parenthood-of-greater-new-york-moves-to-temporarily-pause-deep-sedation-services-in-manhattan-and-close-four-health-centers-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 close}}}\uc2  four health centers pending state approval \u8211\'20\'13 including its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.plannedparenthood.org/health-center/new-york/staten-island/10301/staten-island-center-3978-91110/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 only clinic}}}\uc2  in Staten Island, which currently only offers medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 More than 115 workers at the Manhattan clinic signed a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSchPJB-4GsmTAcsGw1l62qDtAiEyfj_Fg_QqCuiuwhnDnom_w/viewform"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 petition}}}\uc2  to PPGNY leadership on 2 August urging them to renew the contract with the anaesthesia provider. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.asahq.org/standards-and-practice-parameters/statement-on-continuum-of-depth-of-sedation-definition-of-general-anesthesia-and-levels-of-sedation-analgesia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Deep sedation}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 one level below general anaesthesia \u8211\'20\'13 is an important option for minors, sexual assault survivors and people with PTSD and other mental health diagnoses, the staffers wrote. They added that, of the clinic\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  patients who don\u8217\'20\'19t use pills, about 80% opt for deep sedation.\par \par \uc2 The affiliate has quietly cut back on services weeks ahead of the scheduled change, clinic staff say.\par \par \uc2 One employee said deep sedation was now only available for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  patients over 19 weeks and six days of pregnancy, for people allergic to the drugs used for moderate sedation, and for those with substance use disorder. (The drugs are an opioid and a benzodiazepine.) There are no other exceptions, they said.\par \par \uc2 Some patients who booked abortions with deep sedation for August made the necessary and often expensive preparations, only to learn upon arrival that their only options were moderate sedation and local anaesthesia, a second staffer said. Some chose not to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a result, while others felt they had to proceed as they had already taken time off work or arranged childcare. Both staffers asked to remain anonymous for fear of professional retribution.\par \par \uc2 The anaesthesia contractors are still working on-site for the permitted cases until 31 August, even though they are not providing services for patients before 20 weeks.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe had a minor flying in from another state devastated and inconsolable because she was now having to be referred out for deep sedation,\u8221\'20\'1D an anonymous worker said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/25048440-ppgny-staff-dispute-leadership-talking-points-on-abortion-changes-81424-release"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2  issued by 115 anonymous staff members protesting against the change. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ve had to tell a patient who tried to go through with the procedure without deep sedation but couldn\u8217\'20\'19t tolerate it, to get dressed and we wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be able to complete the procedure here, even though our anesthesia provider was sitting 10 feet away,\u8221\'20\'1D reads another staff account.\par \par \uc2 Planned Parenthood of Greater New York\u8217\'20\'19s CEO, Wendy Stark, acknowledged in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/25048435-ppgny-statement-to-the-guardian-8_16_24"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2  that the clinic had \u8220\'20\'1Creserved deep sedation resources in the last month of our contract\u8221\'20\'1D for select patients. Stark said the operational changes were \u8220\'20\'1Cheartbreaking\u8221\'20\'1D to make and cited \u8220\'20\'1Cunprecedented challenges\u8221\'20\'1D facing the affiliate, including budget deficits of \u8220\'20\'1Cwell over $10 million\u8221\'20\'1D. She urged state officials to increase Medicaid reimbursement rates for abortions done with pills.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA lot of people do really well with moderate sedation,\u8221\'20\'1D the first worker said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe just want people to still have this option.\u8221\'20\'1D The other added: \u8220\'20\'1CWe have a lot of patients who prefer to be asleep, for whatever reasons that they choose.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  leadership said at a June meeting that the new gestational limit would affect a small number of people as \u8220\'20\'1Conly\u8221\'20\'1D 282 patients had abortions after 20 weeks in 2023. The staffers wrote in the petition: \u8220\'20\'1CAs healthcare workers, we consider this intolerable collateral damage.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The workers call on the PPGNY, New York state and donors to \u8220\'20\'1Cfind a way\u8221\'20\'1D to prevent the service cuts.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240817ek8h0015w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
