\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Project 2025 architect compared  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  to slavery and the Holocaust\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 639 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 August 2024\par 16:16 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Kevin Roberts, who leads thinktank that drafted blueprint for second Trump presidency, made remark in January\par \par \uc2 In a speech earlier this year, Kevin Roberts, the architect of Project 2025, a vast plan for a second Trump administration, compared \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slavery, lynchings, the Holocaust, antisemitic violence and terror attacks.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEvery slave auction, every lynching, every concentration camp, every \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  mill, every pogrom, every terrorist bombing from the Middle East to Kermit Gosnell, from Herod to Hitler to \uc2 Hamas\uc2 , has been justified on the same inhuman pretense that the victims aren\u8217\'20\'19t really people,\u8221\'20\'1D Roberts said.\par \par \uc2 The remarks were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mediamatters.org/kevin-roberts/project-2025-architect-kevin-roberts-compared-abortion-access-slave-auctions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  by \uc2 Media Matters for America\uc2 , a progressive watchdog.\par \par \uc2 Gosnell, an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doctor in Philadelphia, was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2013/may/15/philadelphia-abortion-doctor-kermit-gosnell-sentenced-life"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sentenced to life}}}\uc2  in prison in 2013, for the murder of three babies.\par \par \uc2 Roberts is the president of \uc2 the Heritage Foundation\uc2 , a hard-right thinktank. He spoke about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Washington DC in January, at the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://prolifesummit.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 National Pro-Life Summit}}}\uc2 , hosted by Students for Life in America, a Project 2025 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.project2025.org/about/advisory-board/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 advisory board}}}\uc2  member.\par \par \uc2 Project 2025 is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.project2025.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 900-plus-page policy plan}}}\uc2  for rightwing change at every level of federal government. \uc2 The Heritage Foundation\uc2  has coordinated such plans since 1980 but Democrats and progressive groups have successfully raised alarm over Project 2025, regarding {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/05/project-2025-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reproductive}}}\uc2  rights, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/sep/15/project-2025-policy-manifesto-lgbtq-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LGBTQ+ rights}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/feb/09/trump-epa-plan-environment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 environmental}}}\uc2  protections and other concerns.\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  and \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2 , the Democratic nominees for president and vice-president, have made Project 2025 a key part of their campaign, their attacks echoed by candidates for Congress and state posts.\par \par \uc2 Trump, his running mate, JD Vance, and key advisers have sought to back away. Earlier this week, a Trump spokesperson told the \uc2 Washington Post\uc2 , which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/08/donald-trump-kevin-roberts-project-2025-flight"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  links between Trump and Roberts including shared flights, Project 2025 \u8220\'20\'1Chas never and will never be an accurate reflection of President Trump\u8217\'20\'19s policies\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Efforts to limit damage continue. Last month the Project 2025 director, Paul Dans, stepped down, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/30/project-2025-director-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly}}}\uc2  under pressure from Trump\u8217\'20\'19s campaign. Earlier this week, as Democrats in Congress {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://huffman.house.gov/media-center/press-releases/huffman-pressley-demand-heritage-president-come-before-congress-release-project-2025s-secret-180-day-plan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 demanded}}}\uc2  publication of Project 2025 plans for the first 180 days of a second Trump administration, which remain under wraps, a book by Roberts and introduced by Vance was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/books/article/2024/aug/07/project-2025-roberts-jd-vance-introduction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 delayed}}}\uc2  until after election day.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, Roberts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mediamatters.org/kevin-roberts/heritage-president-kevin-roberts-says-its-good-trump-attempting-distance-project-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told a podcast}}}\uc2  it was \u8220\'20\'1Cgood\u8221\'20\'1D to see such moves, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CI mean, they\u8217\'20\'19re trying to win an election. Also, legally it\u8217\'20\'19s important for people to know that Project 2025 is independent of any candidate \u8230\'20\'26 we\u8217\'20\'19ve put this together for any candidate to lean on.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But his January remarks about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  added fuel to the fire. Then, Roberts said: \u8220\'20\'1CThe butcher\u8217\'20\'19s bill of history is chillingly clear. Once a society deems certain individuals not fully human, it soon treats them as if they weren\u8217\'20\'19t human at all. And it never stops with one group.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\u8230\'20\'26 Is it any surprise that the same party of death celebrating violence in the womb also justifies, and even cheers, the surgical mutilation of children, the euthanizing of the depressed, the persecution of parents and churchgoers, even a genocidal war to exterminate the Jewish people?\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMake no mistake: This idea of human inequality \u8211\'20\'13 that some people count and some people don\u8217\'20\'19t \u8211\'20\'13 doesn\u8217\'20\'19t come from the media or the government or the elite or the left or even \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2 . It comes straight from hell.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, Harris\u8217\'20\'19s campaign manager, Julie Ch\u225\'00\'E1vez Rodr\u237\'00\'EDguez, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/4801167-harris-campaign-project-2025-director-heritage-foundation-trump-paul-dans/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CProject 2025 is on the ballot because Donald Trump is on the ballot. This is his agenda, written by his allies, for Donald Trump to inflict on our country.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHiding the 920-page blueprint from the American people doesn\u8217\'20\'19t make it less real \u8211\'20\'13 in fact, it should make voters more concerned about what else Trump and his allies are hiding.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240809ek89002ea\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
