\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Who is \uc2 Andy Beshear\uc2 , the Kentucky governor who could be Harris\u8217\'20\'19s vice-presidential pick?\b0\par\par\uc2 Joan E Greve \par \uc2 829 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 August 2024\par 01:12 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Beshear has the highest approval rating of any Democratic governor in the country, which is astounding in a red state\par \par \uc2 Andy Beshear\uc2 , the governor of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kentucky"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kentucky}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kfvs12.com/2024/08/01/gov-beshear-cancels-planned-stop-western-ky/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 canceled}}}\uc2  a planned appearance in the western part of his state on Friday with no official explanation, intensifying speculation over whether {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris}}}\uc2  might choose him as her running mate.\par \par \uc2 Beshear\u8217\'20\'19s schedule change is far from a guarantee that Harris will select him considering that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/pennsylvania"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pennsylvania}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s governor, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/02/josh-shapiro-kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Josh Shapiro}}}\uc2 , another name on the shortlist of potential running-mates, also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2024/08/01/shapiro-harris-vp-reveal-plans.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 canceled}}}\uc2  a fundraising trip planned for this weekend amid reports that Harris was interviewing a number of vice-presidential candidate contenders over the weekend.\par \par \uc2 Shapiro is widely viewed as a frontrunner in the veepstakes, as Democrats hope he could help deliver the key battleground state of Pennsylvania, but Beshear\u8217\'20\'19s supporters insist he is best positioned to sway independent voters in the presidential race. According to a recent \uc2 Morning Consult{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://spectrumnews1.com/ky/louisville/news/2024/07/24/kentucky-andy-beshear-second-most-popular-governor-morning-consult-poll"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 survey}}}\uc2 , Beshear has the highest approval rating of any Democratic governor in the country, with 67% of Kentuckians holding a favorable impression of him.\par \par \uc2 Beshear\u8217\'20\'19s popularity is all the more astounding given the political leanings of his state. In 2020, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  defeated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/joebiden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Joe Biden}}}\uc2  by 26 points in Kentucky, and no Democratic presidential candidate has carried the state since 1996.\par \par \uc2 Despite those significant hurdles, Beshear won re-election to a second term last year by five points, besting the then Republican attorney general, \uc2 Daniel Cameron\uc2 . The victory came four years after Beshear defeated a deeply unpopular Republican incumbent, \uc2 Matt Bevin\uc2 , by just 0.4 points. The surprise victory was made possible in part because of Beshear\u8217\'20\'19s high name recognition, as his father, Steve Beshear, served as Kentucky\u8217\'20\'19s governor for two terms.\par \par \uc2 Beshear\u8217\'20\'19s strong performance last year was credited to his consistent leadership of the state through the coronavirus pandemic and multiple natural disasters. The governor pitched himself as a hard-working executive capable of rising above politics to do what is right for his state, an argument that he has reiterated at Harris campaign events in recent days.\par \par \uc2 At a rally in Georgia last weekend, Beshear contrasted himself with Republican vice-presidential nominee JD Vance, who grew up in Ohio but touted his family connections to Kentucky in his memoir Hillbilly Elegy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI mean, there\u8217\'20\'19s a county that JD Vance says he\u8217\'20\'19s from in Kentucky \u8211\'20\'13 and I won it by 22 points last November,\u8221\'20\'1D Beshear said.\par \par \uc2 While Beshear emphasized his experience as he sought re-election last year, he also cast a spotlight on one of the social issues that may decide the presidential race: \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access. A year after Kentucky voters {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/politics/kentucky-voters-reject-constitutional-amendment-on-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rejected}}}\uc2  a ballot measure stipulating that the state constitution did not protect reproductive rights, Beshear capitalized on his opponent\u8217\'20\'19s anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  views in a searing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hRYVgGKdtxE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 campaign ad}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The ad featured a woman named Hadley Duvall, who shared that she was raped by her stepfather when she was 12. Duvall condemned Cameron\u8217\'20\'19s support for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban as a severe threat to Kentuckians.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnyone who believes there should be no exceptions for rape and incest could never understand what it\u8217\'20\'19s like to stand in my shoes,\u8221\'20\'1D Duvall said in the ad. \u8220\'20\'1CTo tell a 12-year-old girl she must have the baby of her stepfather who raped her is unthinkable. I\u8217\'20\'19m speaking out because women and girls need to have options. \uc2 Daniel Cameron\uc2  would give us none.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Even though Beshear leaned into the issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access during his campaign, reproductive rights groups have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2024-election/andy-beshear-abortion-record-kentucky-harris-vp-rcna163974"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 questioned}}}\uc2  his record. They note that Beshear often focuses on pregnancies involving rape or incest when he discusses \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and that his lieutenant governor, Jacqueline Coleman, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.courier-journal.com/story/news/politics/2019/02/19/andy-beshear-running-mate-jacqueline-coleman-calls-herself-prolife-democrat/2908232002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previously}}}\uc2  described herself as \u8220\'20\'1Ca pro-life compassionate Democrat\u8221\'20\'1D. (Coleman has more recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JColemanKY/status/1816919146229301526"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 endorsed}}}\uc2  Harris and condemned the overturning of Roe v Wade.)\par \par \uc2 Speaking to reporters in Georgia last weekend, Beshear forcefully rejected any suggestion that he was weak on reproductive rights. He reminded them of his multiple vetoes of anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bills, even though some of those proposals were enacted anyway because of the Republican supermajority in the state legislature.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m the first Democrat in Kentucky that has ever run an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ad?? during an election,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2024-election/andy-beshear-abortion-record-kentucky-harris-vp-rcna163974"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  reporters. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19ve stood up every single time, knowing that it would be one of the No 1 attacks on me.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Questions over Beshear\u8217\'20\'19s stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  could play an important role in Harris\u8217\'20\'19s deliberations, as she has placed a heavy emphasis on the issue since formally launching her campaign last week. But if Beshear joins Harris\u8217\'20\'19s ticket, he will probably follow the example of his predecessors by embracing the agenda of the presidential nominee.\par \par \uc2 Harris\u8217\'20\'19s announcement is expected no later than Tuesday, when she will appear at a rally in Pennsylvania with her new running mate.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240804ek84001e4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
