\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Harris urges Americans to vote after six-week  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban takes effect in Iowa\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 540 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2024\par 19:06 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Court reinstates ban after lengthy legal battle in a decision pro-choice advocates call \u8216\'20\'18violation of human rights\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , the likely Democratic nominee for president, urged Americans to vote after a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban took effect in Iowa on Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis ban is going to take effect before many women even know they\u8217\'20\'19re pregnant,\u8221\'20\'1D Harris said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pdPoSOE7GGw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 video posted to YouTube}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CWhat this means is that one in three women of reproductive age in America lives in a state with a Trump \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 During the 33-second clip, Harris used the phrase \u8220\'20\'1CTrump \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban\u8221\'20\'1D three times \u8211\'20\'13 part of a wider effort by her campaign to blame her rival Donald Trump, who appointed three of the supreme court justices who overturned Roe v Wade and enabled states to outlaw \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , for the spate of unpopular bans that now blanket the south and midwest.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Republican}}}\uc2  -dominated Iowa state legislature {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/jul/12/iowa-passes-six-week-abortion-ban#:~:text=Iowa's%20state%20legislature%20voted%20on,people%20know%20they%20are%20pregnant."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 passed the ban last year}}}\uc2 , but a lengthy court battle initially stopped it from taking effect. Last month, the Iowa supreme court ruled that the ban could be enforced, leading a lower-court judge to rule it could take effect on Monday morning at 8am local time.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe upholding of this \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban in Iowa is an absolute devastation and violation of human rights, depriving Iowans of their bodily autonomy,\u8221\'20\'1D Leah Vanden Bosch, development and outreach director of the Iowa \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Access Fund, said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CWe know a ban will not stop the need for abortions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Up until Sunday, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been legal in Iowa up to roughly 22 weeks of pregnancy. Now, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics in the state {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/23/iowa-abortion-law-six-weeks#:~:text=An%20Iowa%20judge%20has%20ruled,blocked%20it%20from%20being%20enforced."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have indicated}}}\uc2  that they will continue offering the procedure to the legal limit. The closest options for Iowans who want abortions after six weeks of pregnancy will probably be Minnesota and Illinois, Democratic-run states that border Iowa and that have become \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  havens since Roe v Wade was overturned in 2022.\par \par \uc2 The Iowa ban permits abortions past six weeks in cases of rape or incest, or in medical emergencies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2023/nov/10/state-abortion-laws-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fourteen other states}}}\uc2  enacted near-total bans on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned Roe. Three other states \u8211\'20\'13 Georgia, South Carolina and Florida \u8211\'20\'13 have banned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  past about six weeks of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 Roe\u8217\'20\'19s demise led to surge in support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, even in red states. Sixty-one per cent of Iowans, including 70% of women, say that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be legal in all or most cases, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.desmoinesregister.com/story/news/politics/iowa-poll/2023/03/27/iowa-poll-most-iowans-back-legal-abortion-as-iowa-supreme-court-mulls-limits-roe-v-wade/69990037007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Des Moines Register/Mediacom Iowa poll found}}}\uc2  last year.\par \par \uc2 The end of Roe has made \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights one of the top issues in the 2024 election. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Harris}}}\uc2 , the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/22/kamala-harris-abortion-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 face of the issue for Democrats}}}\uc2 , has said that she would sign a bill codifying Roe\u8217\'20\'19s protections into law. On the other side of the aisle, Trump, the Republican nominee has tried to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/19/republican-convention-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 downplay the issue}}}\uc2  as it has become a liability for Republicans.\par \par \uc2 Kim Reynolds\uc2 , Iowa\u8217\'20\'19s Republican governor, celebrated the ban, calling it a \u8220\'20\'1Cvictory for life\u8221\'20\'1D. In a statement, she added: \u8220\'20\'1CThere is nothing more sacred and no cause more worthy than protecting innocent unborn lives.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240729ek7t0025t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
