\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 JD Vance called for \u8216\'20\'18federal response\u8217\'20\'19 to block women from traveling for abortions\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 830 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 July 2024\par 18:44 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 VP nominee pushed baseless warning in 2022 that \uc2 George Soros\uc2  would pack planes of Black women to get abortions\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/jd-vance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 JD Vance}}}\uc2 , the Ohio senator and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s running mate, promoted a baseless rightwing talking point in 2022 when he warned of \uc2 George Soros\uc2 -funded planes transporting Black women across state lines for abortions.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m sympathetic to the view that like, okay, look here, here\u8217\'20\'19s a situation \u8211\'20\'13 let\u8217\'20\'19s say Roe v Wade is overruled,\u8221\'20\'1D Vance said in a recently resurfaced podcast interview. \u8220\'20\'1COhio bans \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2022, or let\u8217\'20\'19s say 2024. And then, you know, every day \uc2 George Soros\uc2  sends a 747 to Columbus to load up disproportionately Black women to get them to go have abortions in California. And of course, the left will celebrate this as a victory for diversity \u8211\'20\'13 uh, that\u8217\'20\'19s kind of creepy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned Roe in 2022. Vance\u8217\'20\'19s statements echo a common anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  talking point accusing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers and their supporters of targeting people of color.\par \par \uc2 Black women did seek abortions at a higher rate before Roe fell, but public health experts say that this is far from proof of a racist conspiracy. They point to a number systemic factors \u8211\'20\'13 for example, Black women are more likely to live in areas where it\u8217\'20\'19s harder to access contraception. They are also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/may/15/black-women-abortion-bans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disproportionately harmed}}}\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans.\par \par \uc2 Vance continued: \u8220\'20\'1CAnd, and it\u8217\'20\'19s like, if that happens, do you need some federal response to prevent it from happening? Because it\u8217\'20\'19s really creepy. And I\u8217\'20\'19m pretty sympathetic to that actually. So, you know, how hopefully we get to a point where Ohio bans \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in California and the Soroses of the world respect it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While \uc2 Open Society Foundations\uc2 , which was founded by Soros, does support reproductive rights, the billionaire philanthropist is not directing planes to swoop up Black women for abortions. He has been the target of antisemitic conspiracy theories for years.\par \par \uc2 Vance\u8217\'20\'19s comments {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/07/17/politics/kfile-jd-vance-abortion-comments/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 were reported by CNN}}}\uc2 . On Thursday evening, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s campaign posted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/KamalaHQ/status/1816648974549369095"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 audio of the remarks on X}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/16/jd-vance-abortion-rights-groups"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vance\u8217\'20\'19s record on \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  has come under national scrutiny since Trump picked the Hillbilly Elegy author as his vice-presidential running mate. In 2022, Vance suggested he would support a national 15-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban with exceptions. But, like other Republicans wary of the political fallout of Roe\u8217\'20\'19s demise, Vance has more recently sought to soften his position and said in an interview that \u8220\'20\'1Cwe have to accept people do not want \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans\u8221\'20\'1D. He has also expressed support for the availability of mifepristone, a common \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, and said he agrees with Trump\u8217\'20\'19s position that states should decide their own \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws. (Trump has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/19/republican-convention-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flip-flopped on this stance}}}\uc2 .)\par \par \uc2 But in January 2023, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/24834197-20230123-letter-on-comstock-to-doj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vance signed ont o a letter}}}\uc2  urging the Department of Justice to use the Comstock Act, a 19th-century anti-obscenity law, to ban the mailing of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills nationwide. Since Roe\u8217\'20\'19s fall, anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists have begun claiming that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/20/comstock-act-democrats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Comstock Act remains good law}}}\uc2  and can be used to enforce a federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. Project 2025, a wish list for a conservative administration written by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/26/kevin-roberts-project-2025-opus-dei"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 influential thinktank Heritage Foundation}}}\uc2 , reiterates this argument.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSenator Vance has made his position clear: he agrees with President Trump that each state should have the chance to individually set their own \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws,\u8221\'20\'1D Taylor Van Kirk, a spokeswoman for Vance, said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CDesperate attacks from Democrats will not distract voters from the deadly effects of Kamala\u8217\'20\'19s wide-open border, the untenable cost of living caused by her inflationary spending or any other aspect of her far-left, radical agenda.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Vance\u8217\'20\'19s vice-presidential run is off to a rocky start, and he has spent the last week haunted by other resurfaced remarks. In a 2021 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxnews.com/video/6265796735001"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview with Tucker Carlson}}}\uc2 , Vance said that the United States and the Democratic party wwere run \u8220\'20\'1Cby a bunch of childless cat ladies, who are miserable at their own lives and the choices that they\u8217\'20\'19ve made and so they want to make the rest of the country miserable too\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 He then named Harris, who has two step-children, as an example, along with \uc2 Pete Buttigieg\uc2  (who has since had children) and \uc2 Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThe entire future of the Democrats is controlled by people without children,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd how does it make sense that we\u8217\'20\'19ve turned our country over to people who don\u8217\'20\'19t really have a direct stake in it?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Those comments have provoked an uproar, drawing condemnation even from relatively apolitical celebrities like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/article/2024/jul/25/jennifer-aniston-criticises-jd-vance-childless-cat-ladies-comment-about-kamala-harris-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jennifer Aniston}}}\uc2 . Kerstin Emhoff, the ex-wife of Harris\u8217\'20\'19s husband Doug Emhoff, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/07/24/politics/kerstin-emhoff-defends-kamala-harris-sexism/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called the attacks}}}\uc2  on the presumptive Democratic nominee \u8220\'20\'1Cbaseless\u8221\'20\'1D and praised her co-parenting. In an \uc2 Instagram\uc2  story, Harris\u8217\'20\'19s step-daughter Ella Emhoff posted: \u8220\'20\'1CI love my three parents.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240726ek7q0028t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
